hadiths[258]{hadithnumber,text}:
"603","(namaz ke waqt ke elaan ke liye) logon ne aag aur naaqoos ka zikr kya. phir yahood w nasara ka zikr aa gaya. phir Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye hukm hua ke azan ke kalimaat 2-2 martaba kahin aur iqamat mein eik-eik martaba."
"604","jab musalman ( hijrat karke ( Madina pahunchey to waqt muqarrar karke Namaz ke liye aatey they. uske liye azan nahi di jati thi. aik din us barey mein mashwara hua. kisi ne kaha nasara ki tarah aik ghanta ley liya jaey aur kisi ne kaha ke yahudiyon ki tarah narsingha (bigul bana lo, usko phoonk diya karo) lekin umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke kisi shakhs ko kyon na bhej diya jaey jo Namaz ke liye pukar diya kare. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (usi raey ko pasand farmaya aur Bilal se) farmaya ke Bilaal! uth aur Namaz ke liye azan de."
"605","Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm diya gaya ke azan ke kalimaat 2-2 martaba kahin aur siwa (qad qaamatissalaat) ke takbeer ke kalimaat eik-eik baar kahein."
"606","jab musalman zyada ho gaey to mashwara hua ke kisi aisi cheez ke zariey Namaz ke waqt ka elaan ho jisey sab log samajh lein. kuchh logon ne zikr kya ke aag roshan ki jaey. ya narsingha ke zariey elaan karein. lekin aakhir mein Bilal ko hukm diya gaya ke azan ke kalimaat 2-2 baar kahein aur takbeer ke eik-eik baar."
"607","Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm diya gaya ke azan ke kalimaat 2-2 baar kahein aur takbeer mein yahi kalimaat eik-eik baar. Ismail ne bataya ke maine Ayub sakhtiyan se us hadis ka zikr kya to unhon-ne kaha magar lafz (qad qaamatissalaat) 2 hi baar kaha jaeyga"
"608","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jab Namaz ke ke liye azan di jati hai to shaitan paadta (hawa khaarij karta) hua badi tezi ke sath peeth mod kar bhaagta hai. taake azan ki awaz na sun sakey aur jab azan khatm ho jati hai to phir wapas aa jata hai. lekin joon hi takbeer shuru hui wo phir peeth mod kar bhaagta hai. jab takbeer bhi khatm ho jati hai to shaitan dobara aa jata hai aur namazi ke dil mein waswasey daalta hai. kehta hai ke falan baat yad kar falan baat yad kar. un baton ki shaitan yad dahaanii karaataa hai jinka usey khayal bhi na tha aur is tarah us shakhs ko ye bhi yad nahi rehta ke usne kitni rakatein padhi hain."
"609","mein dekhta hun ke tumhen bakriyon aur jangal mein rehna pasand hai. isliye jab tum jangal main apni bakriyon ko liye huey maujood ho aur Namaz ke liye azan 2 to tum buland awaz se azan diya karo. kyonke jin w insan balke tamam hi cheezein jo muazzan ki awaz suntii hain qiyamat ke din is par gawahi dengii. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke ye maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai."
"610","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein sath lekar kahin jihad ke liye tashrif ley jatey, to fauran hi hamla nahi kartey they. subah hoti aur phir aap intizar kartey agar azan ki awaz sun letey to hamle ka irada tark kar detey aur agar azan ki awaz na sunai deti to hamla kartey they. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ham khaibar ki taraf gaey aur raat ke waqt wahan pahunchey. subah ke waqt jab azan ki awaz nahi sunai di to aap apni sawari par baith gaey aur main abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke peechhey baith gaya. chalney mein mere qadam Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qadam Mubarak se chhu chhu jatey they. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Khaibar ke log apne tokron aur kudaalon ko liye huey (apne kaam kaaj ko) bahar nikley. to unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha, aur chilla uthey ke ''(Muhammad Allah ki qism Muhammad!) (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) poori fauj samet aa gaey.'' Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha to aap ne farmaya (الله أكبر , الله"
"611","Abu Saeed Al-Khudri se riwayat hai: Allah ke Rasool (ﷺ) ne farmaya: ""Jab bhi tum azan suno"""
"612","Hazrat Isa bin Talha (ra) se riwayat hai: Unhone Hazrat Muawiya (ra) ko ek din yeh kehte suna ke wo Azan ke alfaaz ""Wa ash-hadu anna Muhammadan rasulullah"" tak dohra rahe the."
"613","jab muazzan ne  حى على الصلاة kahaa to Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne لا حول wla قوة إلا بالله kahaa aur kehney lagey ke ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aisa hi kehtey suna hai."
"614","jo shakhs azan sun kar ye kahey اللهم رب هذه الدعوة التامة والصلاة القائمة آت محمدا الوسيلة والفضيلة وابعثه مقاما محمودا الذي"
"615","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar logon ko malum hota ke azan kehney aur Namaz pehli saf mein padhney se kitna sawab milta hai. phir unke liye Qura dalney ke siwaey aur koi chaara nahi baqi rehta, to albatta is par Qura andazi hi kartey aur agar logon ko malum ho jata ke Namaz ke liye jaldi aaney mein kitna sawab milta hai to uske liye doosrey se aagey badhney ki koshish kartey aur agar logon ko malum ho jata ke isha aur subah ki Namaz ka sawab kitna milta hai, to zaroor koolhon ke bal ghaseet'tey huey unke liye aatey."
"616","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik din ham ko Juma ka khutba diya. barish ki wjah se us din achi khasi keechad ho rahi thi. muazzan jab حى على الصلاة par pahuncha to aap ne us se ( الصلاة في الرحال ( kehney ke liye farmaya ke log Namaz apni qiyam gaahon par padh lein. is par log aik doosrey ko dekhney lagey. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke isi tarah mujh se jo afzal they, unhon-ne bhi kya tha aur is mein shak nahi ke Juma wajib hai."
"617","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Bilal to raat rahe azan detey hain. isliye tum log khaatey peetey raho. yahan tak ke ibne-umme-Maktoom azan dein. rawi ne kaha ke wo naa-beenaa they aur us waqt tak azan nahi detey they jab tak unse kaha na jata ke subah ho gaee. subah ho gaee."
"618","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aadat thi ke jab muazzan subah ki azan subah sadiq ke tuloo honey ke baad de chuka hota to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) azan aur takbeer ke beech Namaz qaaim honey se pahley 2 halki si rakatein padhtey."
"619","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) fajr ki azan aur iqamat ke darmyan 2 halki si rakatein padhtey they."
"620","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, dekho Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) raat rahe mein azan detey hain, isliye tum log (sehrii) kha pi saktey ho. jab tak ibne-umme-maktoom azan na dein."
"621","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Bilal ki azan tumhen sehrii khaney se na rok de kyonke wo raat rahe se azan detey hain ya (ye kaha ke) pukaartey hain. taake jo log ibadat ke liye jaagey hain wo aaraam karne ke liye lot jayen aur jo abhi soey huey hain wo hoshiyaar ho jaaein. koi ye na samajh baithey ke fajr ya subah sadiq ho gaee aur aap ne apni ungliyon ke ishaarey se (tulooa' subah ki kaifiyat) bataaii. ungliyon ko uper ki taraf uthaya aur phir aahista se unhein nichey laey aur phir farmaya ke is tarah (fajr hoti hai) Zuhair rawi ne bhi shahadat ki ungli aik dusri par rakhii, phir unhein daain-baaiin taraf phaila diya."
"624","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen martaba farmaya ke har 2 azaanon (azaan w iqaamat) ke darmyan aik Namaz (ka fasl) dusri Namaz se hona chahiye ( teesri martaba farmaya ke) jo shakhs aisa karna chaahey."
"625","aap ne farmaya ke (ahde-risaalat mein) jab muazzan azan deta to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba sutunon ki taraf lapaktey. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne hujre se bahar tashrif latey to log isi tarah Namaz padhtey huey miltey. ye jamat maghrib se pahley ki 2 rakatein thin aur (maghrib mein) azan aur takbeer mein koi zyada fasla nahi hota tha aur Usmaan-bin-jabla aur Abu-Dawud Tiyalisi ne Shoba se us (hadees mein yun naql kya hai ke) azan aur takbeer mein bahut thoda sa fasla hota tha."
"626","jab muazzan subah ki dusri azan de kar chup hota to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey hotey aur farz se pahley 2 rakaat ( sunnat fajr ( halki phulkii ada kartey subah sadiq roshan ho janey ke baad phir dahini karwat par let rehtey. yahan tak ke muazzan takbeer kehney ki itlaa dene ke liye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aataa."
"627","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har 2 azaanon ( azan w takbeer (ke beech mein Namaz hai. har 2 azaanon ke darmyan Namaz hai. phir teesri martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar koi padhna chaahey."
"628","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main apni qaum ( bani Leis (ke chand aadmiyon ke sath hazir hua aur maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat sharif mein bees raaton tak qiyam kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) badey raham dil aur milansaar they. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamarey apne ghar pahunchne ka shauq mehsus kar liya to farmaya ke ab tum ja saktey ho. wahan ja kar apni qaum ko Deen sikhaao aur (safar mein) Namaz padhtey rehna. jab Namaz ka waqt aa jaey to tum mein se aik shakhs azan de aur jo tum mein sabse bada ho wo imamat karaaey."
"629","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik safar mein they. muazzan ne azan deeni chahi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya thanda honey de. phir muazzan ne azan deeni chahi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir yahi farmaya ke thanda honey de. yahan tak ke saaya teelon ke barabar ho gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke garmi ki shiddat dozakh ki bhap se paida hoti hai."
"630","2 log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaey ye kisi safar mein janey waley they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke dekho jab tum safar mein niklo to (namaz ke waqt rastey mein) azan dena phir iqamat kehna , phir jo shakhs tum mein umr mein bada ho Namaz padhaaey ."
"631","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. ham sab ham umr aur naujawaan hi they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hamara bees din w raat qiyam raha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) badey hi raham dil aur milansaar they. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha ke hamein apne watan wapas janey ka shauq hai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ke tum log apne ghar kisey chhod kar aaey ho. ham ne bataya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha ab tum apne ghar jao aur un ghar walon ke sath raho aur unhein bhi Deen sikhaao aur Deen ki baton par amal karne ka hukm karo. Malik ne bahut si chizon ka zikr kya jinke mutaalliq Abu-Ayub ne kaha ke abu-Qilaba ne yun kaha wo baatein mujh ko yad hain ya yun kaha mujh ko yad nahi. aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke isi tarah Namaz padhna jaisey tum ne mujhey Namaz padhtey huey dekha hai aur jab Namaz ka waqt aa jaey to koi aik azan de aur jo tum mein sabse bada ho wo Namaz padhaaey."
"632","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik sard raat mein maqam Zajnaan par azan di phir farmaayaa ألا صلوا في الرحال ke logo! apne-apney thikaanon mein Namaz padh lo aur hamein aap ne batlaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muazzan se azan ke liye farmatey aur ye bhi farmatey ke muazzan azan ke baad keh de ke logo! apne thikaanon mein Namaz padh lo. ye hukm safar ki haalat mein ya sardi ya barsat ki raaton mein tha."
"633","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Abtah mein dekha ke Bilal hazir huey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Namaz ki khabar di phir Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) barchhi lekar aagey badhey aur usey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney (bataur sutrah) maqaame-abtah mein gaad diya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( usko satrah bana kar) Namaz padhai."
"634","unhon-ne Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ko azan detey huey dekha. wo kehtey hain mein bhi unke munh ke sath idhar-udhar munh pherney laga."
"635","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz mein they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuchh logon ke chalney phirney aur bolney ki awaz suni. Namaz ke baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke kya qissa hai logon ne kaha ke ham Namaz ke liye jaldi kar rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aisa na karo. balke jab tum Namaz ke liye aao to waqaar aur sukoon rakho, Namaz ka jo hissey paogey usey padho aur aur jo reh jaey usey ( baad) mein pura kar lo."
"636","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum log takbeer ki awaz sun lo to Namaz ke liye (ma'moolii chaal se) chal pado. sukoon aur waqaar ko (bahar-haal) pakdey rakho aur daud ke mat aao. phir Namaz ka jo hissey miley usey padh lo, aur jo na mil sakey usey baad mein pura kar lo."
"637","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab Namaz ke liye takbeer kahi jaey to us waqt tak na khadey ho jab tak mujhey nikaltey huey na dekh lo."
"638","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Namaz ki takbeer ho to jab tak mujhey dekh na lo khadey na ho aur aahisatagi ko lazim rakho. Sheban ke sath us hadis ko Yahya se Ali bin-Mubarak ne bhi riwayat kya hai."
"639","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (eik din hujrey se) bahar tashrif laaey, iqamat kahi ja chuki thi aur safein barabar ki ja chuki thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab musalley par khadey huey to ham intizar kar rahe they ke ab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) takbeer kehtey hain. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas tashrif le gaey aur farmaya ke apni apni jagah par thahrey raho. ham usi haalat mein thahrey rahe yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dobara tashrif laaey, to sar Mubarak se pani tapak raha tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ghusl kya tha."
"640","Namaz ke liye iqamat kahi ja chuki thi aur logon ne safein seedhi kar li thin. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur aagey badhey. lekin haalate-janaabat mein they ( magar pahley khayal na raha ( isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum log apni apni jagah thahrey raho. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas tashrif laey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghusl kiye huey they aur sar Mubarak se pani tapak raha tha. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko Namaz padhai."
"641","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Khandaq ki jang ke din hazir huey aur kaha ya Rasulullah ! qism Allah ki suraj ghurub honey ko hi tha ke main ab Asr ki Namaz padh saka hun. aap jab haazire-khidmat huey to roza iftaar karne ka waqt aa chuka tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qism Allah ki maine bhi to namaze-Asr nahi padhi hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bathaan ki taraf gaey. mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath hi tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wuzu kya, phir Asr ki Namaz padhi. suraj doob chuka tha. phir iske baad maghrib ki Namaz padhi."
"642","Namaz ke liye takbeer ho chuki thi aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi shakhs se masjid ke aik goshey mein chupkey chupkey kaan mein baatein kar rahe they. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz ke liye jab tashrif laey to log so rahe they."
"643","maine Sabit Bunani se aik shakhs ke mutaalliq masla malum kya jo Namaz ke liye takbeer honey ke baad guftgu karta rahe. is par unhon-ne Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kya ke unhon-ne farmaya ke takbeer ho chuki thi. itney mein aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se raaste mein mila aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Namaz ke liye takbeer kahi janey ke baad bhi rokey rakha."
"644","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai maine irada kar liya tha ke lakdiyon ke jama karne ka hukm dun. phir Namaz ke liye kahoon, uske liye azan di jaey phir kisi shakhs se kahun ke wo imamat karey aur main un logon ki taraf jaun (jo Namaz ba-jamaat mein hazir nahi hotey ( phir unhein unke gharon samet jalaa dun. us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai agar ye jamat mein na Sharik hone-waale log itni baat jaan lein ke unhein masjid mein aik achchhey qism ki gosht wali haddi mil jaeygi ya 2 umda khur hi mil jaeinge to ye isha ki jamat ke liye masjid mein zaroor hazir ho jaaein."
"645","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jamat ke sath Namaz akeley Namaz padhney se sattais darja zyada fazeelat rakhti hai."
"646","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke jamat se Namaz tanha Namaz padhney se pachchis darja zyada fazeelat rakhti hai."
"647","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aadmi ki jamat ke sath Namaz ghar mein ya bazar mein padhney se pachchis darja zyada behtar hai. wjah ye hai ke jab aik shakhs wuzu karta hai aur uske tamam aadaab ko malhooz rakh kar achi tarah wuzu karta hai phir masjid ka rasta pakadta hai aur siwa Namaz ke aur koi doosra irada uska nahi hota, to har qadam par uska aik darja badhtaa hai aur aik gunah maaf kya jata hai aur jab Namaz se farigh ho jata hai to Farishtey us waqt tak uske liye barabar duaein kartey rahtey hain jab tak wo apne musalley par betha rahe. kehtey hain ( اللهم صل عليه  اللهم"
"648","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jamat se Namaz akeley padhney se pachchis darja zyada behtar hai. aur raat din ke Farishtey fajr ki Namaz mein jama hotey hain. phir Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke agar tum padhna chaho to (Sura banii-Israaeel) ki ye aayat padho (إن قرآن الفجر كان"
"649","Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai: Jam'at ki namaz ka sawab akela namaz padhne se 27 guna zyada hai."
"650","(eik martaba ( abu-Darda aaey, badey hi khafa ho rahe they. maine puchha ke kya baat hui, jisne aapko ghazabnaak bana diya. farmaya : Allah ki qism ! Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki shariiat ki koi baat ab main nahi paata. siwa iske ke jamat ke sath ye log Namaz padh letey hain."
"651","Namaz mein sawab ke lihaaz se sabse badh kar wo shakhs hota hai, jo (masjid mein Namaz ke liye) zyada se zyada door se aaey aur jo shakhs Namaz ke intizar mein betha rehta hai aur phir imam ke sath padhta hai us shakhs se ajr mein badh kar hai jo (pahley hi ( padh kar so jaey."
"657","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke munaafiqon par fajr aur isha ki Namaz se zyada aur koi Namaz bhari nahi aur agar unhein malum hota ke unka sawab kitna zyada hai (aur chal na saktey) to ghutnon ke bal ghaseet kar aatey aur mera to irada ho gaya tha ke muazzan se kahun ke wo takbeer kahey, phir main kisi ko Namaz padhaaney ke liye kahun aur khud aag ki chingaariyaan lekar un sab ke gharon ko jalaa dun jo abhi tak Namaz ke liye nahi nikley."
"658","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jab Namaz ka waqt aa jaey to tum donon azan 2 aur iqamat kaho, phir jo tum mein bada hai wo imam baney."
"659","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke malaaika tum mein se us namazi ke liye us waqt tak yun dua kartey rahtey hain. jab tak (namaz padhney ke baad) wo apne musalley par betha rahe ( اللهم اغفر له,اللهم ارحمه (ke aey Allaah! uski maghfirat kar. aey Allaah! is par raham kar. tum mein se wo shakhs jo sirf Namaz ki wjah se ruka hua hai. ghar janey se siwa Namaz ke aur koi cheez uske liye rukawat nahi, to uska (ye Sara waqt) Namaz hi mein shumaar hoga."
"660","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke saat (7) tarah ke aadmi hongey. jinko Allah us din apne saaye mein jagah dega. jis din uske saaye ke siwa aur koi saaya na hoga. awwal insaf karne wala baadshaah, doosrey wo naujawaan jo apne rab ki ibadat mein jawaanii ki umang se masroof rahaa, tesraa aisa shakhs jiska dil har waqt masjid mein laga rehta hai, chauthey 2 aisey shakhs jo Allah ke liye aapasii mohabbat rakhtey hain aur unke milney aur juda honey ki buniyad yahi ( للهى ( (Allah ke liye muhabbat) mohabbat hai, paanchwaan wo shakhs jisey kisi baa-izzat aur Husain aurat ne ( burey irade se) bulaya lekin usne keh diya ke main Allah se darta hon, chhataa wo shakhs jisne sadqa kya, magar itney chhipe taur par ke baaein hath ko bhi khabar nahi hui ke daahiney hath ne kya kharch kya. saatwaan wo shakhs jisne tanhai mein Allah ko yad kya aur (be-saakhta) aankhon se aansu jari ho gaey."
"661","kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne koi anguthi pehni hai? aap ne farmaya ke haan! aik raat isha ki Namaz mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aadhi raat tak der ki. Namaz ke baad hamari taraf mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya, log Namaz padh kar so chukey hongey aur tum log us waqt tak Namaz hi ki haalat mein they jab tak tum Namaz ka intizar kartey rahe. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya jaisey us waqt mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki anguthi ki chamak dekh raha hun (yani Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki anguthi ki chamak ka samaan meri aankhon mein hai)."
"662","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs masjid mein subah-Shaam baar-baar haziri deta hai. Allah Taala jannat mein uski mehmani ka saman karega . wo subah-Shaam jab bhi masjid mein jaey."
"663","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka guzar aik shakhs par hua (doosri sanad) imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke mujh se Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Bashar ne bayan kya, kaha ke ham se Bahaz-bin-Asad ne bayan kya. kaha ke ham se Shoba ne bayan kya, kaha ke mujhey Sad bin Ibrahim ne khabar di, kaha ke maine Hafs-bin-Aasim se suna, kaha ke maine qabila Azd ke aik sahib se jinka naam Maalik-bin Buhaina (Raziallahu anhu) tha, suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki nazar aik aisey namazi par padi jo takbeer ke baad 2 rakaat Namaz padh raha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Namaz se farigh ho gaey to log us shakhs ke ird-gird jama ho gaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya subah ki char rakatein padhta hai? kya subah ki char rakatein ho gain ? is hadis ki mutabiat (pairavi) ghandar aur Muaz ne Shoba se ki hai jo Malik se riwayat kartey hain. ibne- Ishaq ne Sad se, unhon-ne Hafs se, wo Abdullaah-bin-Buhaina se aur Hammad ne kaha ke hamein Sad ne Hafs ke waaste se khabar di aur wo Malik ke waasta se."
"664","ham Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir they. ham ne Namaz mein hameshgii aur uski ta'zeem ka zikr kya. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke marzul-maut mein jab Namaz ka waqt aaya aur azan di gaee to farmaya ke Abu-Bakar se kaho ke logon ko Namaz padhaaein. us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha gaya ke Abu-Bakar badey narm dil hain. agar wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jagah khadey hongey to Namaz padhaanaa unke liye mushkil ho jaeygi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir wahi hukm farmaya, aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney phir wahi baat dohra di gaee. teesri martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum to bilkul Yusuf ki sath wali aurton ki tarah ho. (ke dil mein kuchh hai aur zahir kuchh aur kar rahi ho ( Abu-Bakar se kaho ke wo Namaz padhaaein. aakhir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz padhaaney ke liye tashrif laey. itney main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne marz mein kuchh kami mehsus ki aur 2 aadmiyon ka sahara lekar bahar tashrif ley gaey. maano main us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qadmon ko dekh rahi hun ke takleef ki wjah se zameen par lakeer kartey jatey they, Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye dekh kar chaha ke peechhey hat jaaein. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ishaare se unhein apni jagah rehney ke liye kaha, phir unke qareeb aaey aur bazu mein baith gaey. jab Aamash ne ye hadis bayan ki, unse puchha gaya ke kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhai aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne aap ki iqtida (pairvi) ki aur logon ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki Namaz ki iqtida (pairvi) ki? Aamash ne sar ke ishaare se batlaya ke haan. Abu-Dawud Tiyalisi ne us hadis ka aik tukda Shoba se riwayat kya hai aur Shoba ne Aamash se aur abu-Muawia ne is riwayat mein ye zyada kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke baain taraf baithey. to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) khadey ho kar Namaz padh rahe they."
"665","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bimar ho gaey aur takleef zyada badh gaee to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon se uski ijazat li ke bimari ke din mere ghar mein guzaarein . unhon-ne uski Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ijazat de di. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif ley gaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qadam zameen par lakeer kar rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) aur aik aur shakhs ke beech mein they (yani donon hazraat ka sahara liye huey they) Ubaidullah rawi ne bayan kya ke maine ye hadis Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan ki, to aap ne farmaya us shakhs ko bhi jantey ho, jinka naam Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne nahi liya. maine kaha ke nahi ! aap ne farmaya ke wo doosrey aadmi Ali (Raziallahu anhu) they."
"666","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik thandii aur barsat ki raat mein azan di, phir yun pukar kar keh diyaa ألا صلوا في الرحال ke logo! apni qiyam gaahon par hi Namaz padh lo. phir farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sardi w barish ki raaton mein muazzan ko hukm detey they ke wo elaan kar de ke logo apni qiyam gaahon par hi Namaz padh lo."
"667","bin Malik Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) naa-beenaa they aur wo apni qaum ke imam they. unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! andherii aur sailaab ki raatein hoti hain aur main andha hon, isliye aap mere ghar mein kisi jagah Namaz padh lijiye taake main wahin apni Namaz ki jagah bana loon. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke ghar tashrif laey aur puchha ke tum kahan Namaz padhna pasand karogey. unhon-ne ghar mein aik jagah batla di aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wahan Namaz padhi."
"668","hamein aik din Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne jabke barish ki wjah se keechad ho rahi thi khutba sunaya. phir muazzan ko hukm diya aur jab wo حى على الصلاة par pahuncha to aap ne farmaya ke aaj yun pukar pukaar ( الصلاة في الرحال (ke Namaz apni qiyam gaahon par padh lo. log aik doosrey ko (hairat ki wjah se) dekhney lagey. jaisey usko unhon-ne naajaaiz samjhaa. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke aisa malum hota hai ke tum ne shayad usko bura jana hai. aisa to mujh se behtar zaat yani Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi kya tha. beshak Juma wajib hai magar maine ye pasand nahi kya ke (حى على الصلاة) keh kar tumhen bahar nikaalun (aur takleef mein mubtala karoon) aur Hammad Aasim se, wo Abdullah-bin-Haaris se, wo Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se, isi tarah riwayat kartey hain. albatta unhon-ne itna aur kaha ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke mujhey achchha malum nahi hua ke tumhen gunahgaar karun aur tum us haalat mein aao ke tum mitti mein ghutnon tak aalooda ho gaey ho."
"669","maine Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se ( shabe-qadr ko) poochha. aap ne farmaya ke badal ka aik tukda aaya aur barsa yahan tak ke (masjid ki chhat ( tapakney lagi jo khajoor ki shakhon se banai gaee thi. phir Namaz ke liye takbeer hui. maine dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) keechad aur pani mein sajda kar rahe they. keechad ka nishan aap ki peshani par bhi maine dekha."
"670","Ansar mein se aik mard ne uzr pesh kya ke main aap ke sath Namaz mein Sharik nahi ho sakta aur wo mota aadmi tha. us ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye khana taiyaar kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne ghar dawat di aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye aik chatai bichhaa di aur uske aik kinare ko) saaf karke) dho diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us boriye par 2 rakatein padhin. aale-Jaarood ke aik shakhs (abdul-Hameed) ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chasht ki Namaz padhtey they, to unhon-ne farmaya ke us din ke siwa aur kabhi maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko padhtey nahi dekha."
"671","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar Sham (Syria) ka khana samney rakha jaey aur idhar Namaz ke liye takbeer bhi honey lagey to pahley khana kha lo."
"672","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab Sham (Syria) ka khana hazir kya jaey to maghrib ki Namaz se pahley khana kha lo aur khaney mein be maza bhi na hona chahiye aur apna khana chhod kar Namaz mein jaldi mat karo."
"673","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se kisi ka Sham ka khana taiyaar ho chuka ho aur takbeer bhi kahi ja chuki ho to pahley khana kha lo aur Namaz ke liye jaldi na karo, khaney se faraghat kar lo aur Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye khana rakh diya jata, idhar iqamat bhi ho jati lekin aap khaney se farigh honey tak Namaz mein Sharik nahi hotey they. aap imam ki qirat barabar suntey rahtey they."
"674","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tum mein se koi khana kha raha ho to jaldi na karey, balke poori tarah kha ley, halaanki Namaz khadi kyon na ho gaee ho. abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (rh)) ne kaha aur mujh se Ibrahim bin al-Munzir ne Wahab bin Usman se ye hadis bayan ki aur Wahab madni hain."
"675","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bakri ki raan ka gosht kaat-kaat kar kha rahe they. itney mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz ke liye bulaey gaey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur chhuri daal di, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhai aur wuzu nahi kya."
"676","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ghar mein kya kiya kartey they aap ne batlaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ghar ke kaam kaaj yani apne ghar waaliyon ki khidmat kya kartey they aur jab Namaz ka waqt hota to fauran ( kaam kaaj chhod kar) Namaz ke liye chaley jatey they."
"677","main tum logon ko Namaz padhaaunga aur meri niyat Namaz padhney ki nahi hai, mera maqsad sirf ye hai ke tumhen Namaz ka wo tariqa sikhaa dun jis tareeqe se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz padha kartey they. maine abu-Qilaba se puchha ke unhon-ne kis tarah Namaz padhi thi? unhon-ne batlaya ke hamarey Shekh (Umar-bin Salma) ki tarah. Shekh jab sajde se sar uthatey to zara baith jatey phir khadey hotey."
"678","aap ne farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bimar huey aur jab bimari shiddat ikhtiyar kar gaee to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaho ke wo logon ko Namaz padhaaein. is par Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) boliin ke wo narm-dil hain jab aap ki jagah khadey hongey to unke liye Namaz padhaanaa mushkil hoga. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya ke Abu-Bakar se kaho ke wo Namaz padhaaein. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne phir wahi baat kahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya ke Abu-Bakar se kaho ke Namaz padhaaein, tum log Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ki aurton ki tarah (baatein banaatii) ho. aakhir Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aadmi bulaney aaya aur aap ne logon ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi mein hi Namaz padhai."
"679","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni bimari mein farmaya ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se Namaz padhaaney ke liye kaho. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan karti hain ke maine arz kya ke Abu-Bakar aap ki jagah khadey hongey to rotey-rotey wo ( Quran Majeed ( suna na sakengey , isliye aap umr (Raziallahu anhu) se kahey ke wo Namaz padhaaein. aap farmati thin ke maine Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se kaha ke wo bhi kahein ke agar Abu-Bakar aap ki jagah khadey huey to rotey-rotey logon ko) Quran ( na suna sakengey . isliye umr (Raziallahu anhu) se kahey ke wo Namaz padhaaein. Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ( Ummul-Momenin aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki sahibzadi ( ne bhi isi tarah kaha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khamosh raho. tum Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ki aurton ki tarah ho Abu-Bakar se kaho ke wo logon ko Namaz padhaaein. to phir Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se kaha, bhala mujh ko kahin tum se bhalai pahunch sakti hai?"
"680","ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke marzul-maut mein Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz padhatey they. peer ke din jab log Namaz mein saf baandhey khadey huey they, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hujre ka parda hataaey khadey huey, hamari taraf dekh rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra Mubarak ( Husn w jamaal aur safaaii mein) maano kisi kitab ka waraq tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskuraa kar hansney lagey. hamein itni khushi hui ke khatrah ho gaya ke kahin ham sab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhney hi mein na mashghool ho jayen aur Namaz tod dein Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ultey paon peechhey hat kar saf ke sath aa milnaa chahtey they. unhon-ne samjha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz ke liye tashrif la rahe hain, lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein ishara kya ke Namaz poori kar lo. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne parda daal diya. to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat isi din ho gaii. اناللہ و انا الیہ راجعون"
"681","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (beemaarii ke dinon mein) teen din tak bahar tashrif nahi laey. un hi dinon mein aik din Namaz qaaim ki gaee Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aagey badhney ko they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( hujra Mubarak ka ( parda uthaya . jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra Mubarak dikhai diya. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke Mubarak chehre se zyada Husain manzar ham ne kabhi nahi dekha tha. (qurbaan us Husn w jamaal ke) phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ko aagey badhney ke liye ishara kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne parda gira diya aur uske baad wafat tak koi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhney par qaadir na ho saka."
"682","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bimari shiddat ikhtiyar kar gaee aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Namaz ke liye kaha gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abu-Bakar se kaho ke wo Namaz padhaaein. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne arz kya ke Abu-Bakar kachchey dil ke aadmi hain. jab wo Quran Majeed padhtey hain to bahut roney lagtey hain. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke un hi se kaho ke Namaz padhaaein. dobara unhon-ne phir wahi uzr dohraya . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya ke unse Namaz padhaaney ke liye kaho. tum to bilkul Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ki aurton ki tarah ho. is hadis ki mutabiat (pairavi) Muhammad-bin Waleed Zubaidi aur Zohri ke bhatijey aur Ishaq bin Yahya kalbi ne Zohri se ki hai aur Aqeel aur Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Hamza bin-Abdullaah-bin-Umar se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"683","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni bimari mein hukm diya ke Abu-Bakar logon ko Namaz padhaaein. isliye aap logon ko Namaz padhatey they. Urwa ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik din apne aapko kuchh halka paya aur bahar tashrif laey. us waqt Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz padha rahe they. unhon-ne jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha to peechhey hatna chaha, lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ishaarey se unhein apni jagah qaaim rehney ka hukm farmaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ke bazu mein baith gaey Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki iqtida (pairvi) kar rahe they aur log Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki pairwi kartey they."
"684","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bani Amr-bin-Auf main ( Quba mein) suleh karaaney ke liye gaey, to Namaz ka waqt aa gaya. muazzan ( Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ne) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se aa kar kaha ke kya aap Namaz padhaaeingey. mein takbeer kahun Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke haan, chunanche Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne Namaz shuru kar di. itney main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif ley aaey to log Namaz mein they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safon se guzar kar pehli saf mein pahunchey . logon ne aik hath ko doosrey par maara (taake Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aamad par aagah ho jaaein) lekin Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz mein kisi taraf tawajjoh nahi detey they. jab logon ne mutwaatir hath par hath maarna shuru kya to siddeeq akbar (Raziallahu anhu) mutwajjeh huey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ishara se unhein apni jagah rehney ke liye kaha, (ke Namaz padhaaey jaao) lekin unhon-ne apne hath utha kar Allah ka shukr kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko imamat ki izzat bakhshii, phir bhi wo peechhey hat gaey aur saf mein shamil ho gaey. isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aagey badh kar Namaz padhai. Namaz se farigh ho kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abu-Bakar jab maine aapko hukm de diya tha phir aap Sabit qadam kyon na rahe Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) boley ke abu-Qahaafa ke betey (yani abu-Bakar) ki ye haisiyat na thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney Namaz padha sakein. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ki taraf Khattab kartey huey farmaya ke ajeeb baat hai. maine dekha ke tum log kasrat se taaliyaan bajaa rahe they. (yaad rakho) agar Namaz mein koi baat pesh aa jaey to Subhan-Allah kehna chahiye jab wo ye kahega to uski taraf tawajjoh ki jaeygi aur ye taali bajanaa aurton ke liye hai."
"685","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main apne mulk se hazir huey. ham sab ham-Umr naujawaan they. taqriban bees raatein ham aap ki khidmat mein thahrey rahe. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) badey hi raham dil they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (hamaarii ghurbat ka haal dekh kar) farmaya ke jab tum log apne gharon ko jao to apne qabeele walon ko Deen ki baatein batana aur unse Namaz padhney ke liye kehna ke falan Namaz falan waqt aur falan Namaz falan waqt padhein aur jab Namaz ka waqt ho jaey to koi aik azan de aur jo Umr mein bada ho wo imamat karaaey."
"686","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (mere ghar tashrif laney ki) ijazat chahi aur maine aapko ijazat di, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tum log apne ghar mein jis jagah pasand karo mein Namaz padh dun mein jahan chahta tha uski taraf maine ishara kya. phir aap khadey ho gaey aur ham ne aap ke peechhey saf baandh li. phir aap ne jab salam phera to ham ne bhi salam phera ."
"687","main Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha, kash! ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bimari ki haalat aap ham se bayan kartin, (to achchha hota ( unhon-ne farmaya ke haan zaroor sun lo. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka marz badh gaya. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke kya logon ne Namaz padh li? ham ne kaha ji nahi ya Rasulullah ! log aap ka intizar kar rahe hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere liye aik lagan mein pani rakh do. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke hamne pani rakh diya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baith kar ghusl kya. phir aap uthney lagey, lekin aap behosh ho gaey. jab hosh hua to phir aap ne puchha ke kya logon ne Namaz padh li hai. ham ne kaha nahi, ya Rasulullah! log aap ka intizar kar rahe hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( phir ( farmaya ke lagan mein mere liye pani rakh do. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) farmati hain ke ham ne phir pani rakh diya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baith kar ghusl farmaya, phir uthney ki koshish ki lekin) dobara ( phir aap behosh ho gaey. jab hosh hua to aap ne phir yahi farmaya ke kya logon ne Namaz padh li hai. ham ne kaha ke nahi ya Rasulullah! log aapka intizar kar rahe hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya ke lagan mein pani lao aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baith kar ghusl kya. phir uthney ki koshish ki, lekin phir aap behosh ho gaey. phir jab hosh hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ke kya logon ne Namaz padh li ham ne kaha ke nahi ya Rasulullah! wo aap ka intizar kar rahe hain. log masjid mein isha ki Namaz ke liye baithey huey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka intizar kar rahe they. aakhir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aadmi bheja aur hukm farmaya ke wo Namaz padha dein. bhejey huey shakhs ne aa kar kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aapko Namaz padhaaney ke liye hukm farmaya hai. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) badey narm dil insan they. unhon-ne umr (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke tum Namaz padhaao, lekin umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne jawab diya ke aap iske zyada haqdaar hain. aakhir (beemaarii) ke dinon mein Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz padhatey rahe. phir jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mizaaj kuchh halka malum hua to 2 mardon ka sahara lekar jin mein aik Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) they Zohar ki Namaz ke liye ghar se bahar tashrif laey aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz padha rahe they, jab unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha to peechhey hatna chaha, lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ishaarey se unhein rokaa ke peechhey na hato! phir aap ne un donon mardon se farmaya ke mujhey Abu-Bakar ke bazu mein bitha do. chunanche donon ne aapko Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke bazu mein bitha diya. rawi ne kaha ke phir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki pairwi kar rahe they aur log Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki Namaz ki pairwi kar rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey-baithey Namaz padh rahe they. Ubaidullah ne kaha ke phir main Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein gaya aur unse kaha ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bimari ke barey mein jo hadis bayan ki hai kya main wo aapko sunaun? unhon-ne farmaya ke zaroor sunao. maine ye hadis suna di. unhon-ne kisi baat ka inkar nahi kya. sirf itna kaha ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne un sahib ka naam bhi tum ko bataya jo Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath they. maine kaha nahi. aap ne farmaya wo Ali (Raziallahu anhu) they."
"688","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik martaba bimari ki haalat mein mere hi ghar mein Namaz padhi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baith kar Namaz padh rahe they aur log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey khadey ho kar padh rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko baithney ka ishara kya aur Namaz se farigh honey ke baad farmaya ke imam isliye hai ke uski pairwi ki jaey. isliye jab wo rukoo mein jaey to tum bhi rukoo mein jao aur jab wo sar uthaey to tum bhi sar uthao aur jab wo (سمع الله لمن حمده) kahey to tum ( ربنا ولك"
"689","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik ghodey par Sawar huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par se gir padey . us se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke daain pahlu par zakhm aaey. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne koi Namaz padhi. jisey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baith kar padh rahe they. isliye ham ne bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey baith kar Namaz padhi. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farigh huey to farmaya ke imam isliye muqarrar kya gaya hai ke uski iqtida (pairvi) ki jaey. isliye jab wo khadey ho kar Namaz padhey to tum bhi khadey ho kar padho aur jab wo rukoo karey to tum bhi rukoo karo. jab wo rukoo se sar uthaey to tum bhi uthao aur jab wo (سمع الله لمن حمده ) kahey to tum ( ربنا ولك الحمد ( kaho aur jab wo baith kar Namaz padhey to tum bhi baith kar padho . abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( ne kaha ke Hameedii ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us qaul ''jab imam baith kar Namaz padhey to tum bhi baith kar padho.'' ke mutaalliq kaha hai ke ye shuruaat mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki puraanii bimari ka waqia hai. iske baad aakhiri bimari mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud baith kar Namaz padhi thi aur log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey khadey ho kar iqtida (pairvi) kar rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us waqt logon ko baithney ki hidayat nahi farmai aur asl ye hai ke jo kaam Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka aakhiri ho usko lena chahiye aur phir jo usse aakhiri ho."
"690","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (سمع الله لمن حمده) kehtey to ham mein se koi bhi us waqt tak na jhuktaa jab tak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajde mein na chaley jatey phir ham log sajde mein jatey. ham se abu-Nueim ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Sufiyan Sory ne, unhon-ne Abu-Ishaq se jaisey uper guzra ."
"690b","Raportat de Abu 'Is-haq:\n\nCa mai sus."
"691","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tum mein wo shakhs jo ( rukoo ya sajde mein) imam se pahley apna sar utha leta hai is baat se nahi darta ke kahin Allah paak iska sar gadhey ke sar ki tarah bana de ya uski sura ko gadhey ki si sura bana de."
"692","jab pahley muhajireen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hijrat se bhi pahley Quba ke maqam usba mein pahunchey to unki imamat abu-Huzaifa ke ghulam Salim (Raziallahu anhu) kya kartey they. aapko Quran Majeed sabse zyada yad tha."
"693","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (apne Hakim ki) suno aur itaat karo, chahe aik aisa habshi ( ghulam tum par) kyon na Hakim bana diya jaey jiska sar sookhey huey angoor ke barabar ho."
"694","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke imam logon ko Namaz padhatey hain. to agar imam ne theek Namaz padhai to uska sawab tumhen milega aur agar ghalati ki to bhi) tumhari Namaz ka ( sawab tum ko milega aur ghalati ka wabaal un par rahega."
"695","wo khud Usman ghanii (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey. jabke baaghiyon ne unko gher rakha tha. unhon-ne kaha ke aap hi aam musalmanon ke imam hain magar aap par jo museebat hai wo aapko malum hai. in halaat mein baaghiyon ka muqarrara imam Namaz padha raha hai. ham dartey hain ke iske peechhey Namaz padh kar gunahgaar na ho jaaein. Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ne jawab diya Namaz to jo log kaam kartey hain un kaamon mein sabse behtreen kaam hai. to wo jab achchha kaam karein tum bhi iske sath mil kar achchha kaam karo aur jab wo bura kaam karein to tum unki burai se alag raho aur Muhammad-bin Yazeed Zubaidi ne kaha ke imam Zohri ne farmaya ke ham to ye samajhtey hain ke heejdey ke peechhey Namaz na padhein. magar aisi hi laachaarii ho to aur baat hai jiske baghair koi chaara na ho."
"696","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu-Zar se farmaya (haakim ki) sun aur itaat kar. chahe wo aik aisa habshi ghulam hi kyon na ho jiska sar munaqqey ke barabar ho."
"697","aik raat main apni khala Ummul-Momenin Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar par reh gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) isha ki Namaz ke baad jab unke ghar tashrif laey to yahan char rakaat Namaz padhi. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey phir Namaz ( tahajjud ke liye) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uthey (aur Namaz padhney lagey ( to main bhi uth kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baain taraf khada ho gaya, lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey apni dahini taraf kar liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne panch rakaat Namaz padhi. phir 2 rakaat ( sunnat fajr ( padh kar so gaey aur maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kharraatey ki awaz bhi suni. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) fajr ki Namaz ke liye aaye."
"698","mein aik raat Ummul-Momenin Memuna ke yahan so gaya. us raat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bhi wahin soney ki baari thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wuzu kya aur Namaz padhney ke liye khadey ho gaey. mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baain taraf khada ho gaya. isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey pakad kar daain taraf kar diya. phir 13 rakaat ( witr samet ( Namaz padhi aur so gaey. yahan tak ke kharraatey leney lagey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab sotey to kharraatey letey they. phir muazzan aaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif ley gaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske baad) fajr ki) Namaz padhi aur wuzu nahi kya. Amr ne bayan kya maine ye hadis Bukair-bin-Abdullaah ke samney bayan ki to unhon-ne farmaya ke ye hadis mujh se Kureb ne bhi bayan ki thi."
"699","maine aik baar apni khala Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar raat guzari . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein Namaz padhney ke liye khadey huey to main bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz mein Sharik ho gaya. main ( ghalati se) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baain taraf khada ho gaya tha. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera sar pakad ke daain taraf kar diya. (taake sahi taur par khada ho jaun ( ."
"700","Muaz-bin-Jabal (rz), Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz padhtey phir wapas aa kar apni qaum ki imamat kya kartey they."
"701","Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) , Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ( farz ( Namaz padhtey phir wapas ja kar apni qaum ke logon ko) wahi ( Namaz padhaayaa kartey they. aik baar isha mein unhon-ne sura al-Baqara shuru ki. ( muqtadiyon mein se) aik shakhs Namaz tod kar chal diya. Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) usko bura kehney lagey. ye khabar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi (is shakhs ne ja kar Muaz ki shikayat ki) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muaz ko farmaya to bula mein dalney wala hai, bula mein dalney waalaa, bula mein dalney wala hai, teen baar farmaya, ya yun farmaya ke to fasaadii hai, fasaadii, fasaadii. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muaz ko hukm farmaya ke mufassal ke beech ki 2 soortein padha kare. Amr-bin-Dinar ne kaha ke mujhey yad na rahen (ke kon si Suraton ka aap ne naam liyaa.)"
"702","aik shakhs ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah! qism Allah ki mein subah ki Namaz mein falan ki wjah se der mein jata hon, kyonke wo Namaz ko bahut lamba kar detey hain, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko nasihat ke waqt us din se zyada ( kabhi bhi) ghazab naak nahi dekha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se kuchh log ye chahtey hain ke) Awam ko ibadat se ya Deen se) nafrat dila dein, khabardaar tum mein logon ko jo shakhs bhi Namaz padhaaey to halki padhaaey. kyonke namaziyon mein kamzor, boodhey aur zarurat waley sab hi qism ke log hotey hain."
"703","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jab koi tum mein se logon ko Namaz padhaaey to mukhtasar karey kyonke jamat mein zaeef bimar aur boodhey (sab hi) hotey hain, lekin akelaa padhey to jis qadr ji chahey lambi padh sakta hai."
"704","aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke ya Rasulullah! main fajr ki Namaz mein derii karke isliye Sharik hota hun ke falan sahib fajr ki Namaz bahut lambi kar detey hain. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is qadr ghussa huey ke maine nasihat ke waqt us din se zyada ghazab naak Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kabhi nahi dekha. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya logo ! tum mein kuchh log (namaz se logon ko) door karne ki wjah bane huey hain. isliye jo shakhs imam ho usey halki Namaz padhni chahiye isliye ke iske peechhey kamzor, boodhey aur zarurat waley sab hi hotey hain."
"705","aik shakhs pani uthaney wala 2 oont liye huey aaya, raat taareek ho chuki thi. usne Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ko Namaz padhatey huey paya. isliye apne oonton ko bitha kar (namaz mein Sharik honey ke liye) Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf badhaa. Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne Namaz mein sura al-Baqara ya sura Nisa shuru ki. chunanche wo shakhs niyat tod kar chal diya. phir usey malum hua ke Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh ko bura bhala kaha hai. isliye wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur Muaz ki shikayat ki, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya, Muaz ! kya tum logon ko fitne mein daltey ho. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen martaba ( فتان (ya ( فاتن ( farmaya :  سبح اسم ربك  Mina والشمس وضحاها  Mina والليل إذا يغشى( soortein ( tum ne kyon na padhein , kyonke tumharey peechhey boodhey, kamzor aur zaroorat-mand Namaz padhtey hain. Shoba ne kaha ke mera khayal hai ke ye aakhiri jumla (kyonke tumharey peechhey) hadis mein dakhil hai. Shoba ke sath uski mutabiat (pairavi) Saeed-bin-Masrooq, Misar aur Shebani ne ki hai aur Amr-bin-Diinaar, Ubaidullaah-bin -Muqsim aur abu-Zubair ne bhi us hadis ko Jaabir ke waaste se bayan kya hai ke Muaz ne isha mein sura al-Baqara padhi thi aur Shoba ke sath is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Aamash ne Maharib ke waaste se ki hai."
"706","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz ko mukhtasar aur poori padhtey they."
"707","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main Namaz der tak padhney ke irade se khada hota hun. lekin kisi bachchey ke roney ki awaz sun kar Namaz ko halki kar deta hun, kyonke uski maan ko (jo Namaz mein Sharik hogi) takleef mein daalnaa bura samajhta hun. Waleed-bin-Muslim ke sath is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) bishr-bin-bakr, Baqiiya-bin-Waleed aur ibne-Mubarak ne Auzai ke waaste se ki hai."
"708","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada halki lekin kaamil Namaz maine kisi imam ke peechhey kabhi nahi padhi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye haal tha ke agar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bachchey ke roney ki awaz sun letey to us khayal se ke uski maan kahin pareshani mein na mubtala ho jaey Namaz mukhtasar kar detey."
"709","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya main Namaz shuru kar deta hun. irada ye hota hai ke Namaz lambi karun lekin bachchey ke roney ki awaz sun kar mukhtasar kar deta hun kyonke mujhey malum hai ke maa ke dil par bachchey ke roney se kaisi chot padtii hai."
"710","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main Namaz ki niyat baandhtaa hon, irada ye hota hai ke Namaz ko lamba karunga, lekin bachchey ke roney ki awaz sun kar mukhtasar kar deta hun kyonke main us dard ko samajhta hun jo bachchey ke roney ki wjah se maan ko ho jata hai. aur Moosaa-bin-Ismaaeel ne kaha ham se Aban bin Yazeed ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Qatada ne, kaha ham se Anas ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi hadis bayan ki."
"711","Muaz (rz), Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz padhtey phir wapas aa kar apni qaum ko Namaz padhatey they."
"712","aap ne batlaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke maut ke marz mein Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz ki itlaa dene ke liye haazire-khidmat huey. aap ne farmaya ke Abu-Bakar se Namaz padhaaney ke liye kaho. maine arz kya ke Abu-Bakar kachchey dil ke aadmi hain agar aap ki jagah khadey hongey to ro dengey aur qirat na kar sakengey . aap ne farmaya ke Abu-Bakar se kaho wo Namaz padhaaein. maine wahi uzr phir dohraayaa. phir aap ne teesri ya chothi martaba farmaya ke tum log to bilkul Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ki aurton ki tarah ho Abu-Bakar se kaho ke wo Namaz padhaaein. khair Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Namaz shuru kara di. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (apnaa mizaaj zara halka pa kar) 2 aadmiyon ka sahara liye huey bahar tashrif laey. maano meri nazron ke samney wo manzar hai ke aap ke qadam zameen par rakh rahe they Abu-Bakar aapko dekh kar peechhey hatney lagey. lekin aap ne ishaare se unhein Namaz padhaaney ke liye kaha Abu-Bakar peechhey hat gaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke bazu mein baithey Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) logon ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki takbeer suna rahe they. Abdullaah-bin-Daawood ke sath us hadis ko muhaazir ne bhi Aamash se riwayat kya hai."
"713","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) zyada bimar ho gaey they, to Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Namaz ki khabar dene aaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abu-Bakar se Namaz padhaaney ke liye kaho. maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah! Abu-Bakar aik narm dil aadmi hain aur jab bhi wo aap ki jagah khadey hongey logon ko (shiddat giryaa ki wjah se) awaz nahi suna sakengey. isliye agar umr (Raziallahu anhu) se kehtey to behtar tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abu-Bakar se Namaz padhaaney ke liye kaho. phir maine Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se kaha ke tum kaho ke Abu-Bakar narm dil aadmi hain aur agar aap ki jagah khadey huey to logon ko apni awaz nahi suna sakengey . isliye agar umr se kahein to behtar hoga. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum log Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ki aurton se kam nahi ho Abu-Bakar se kaho ke Namaz padhaaein. jab Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz padhaaney lagey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne marz mein kuchh halkaapan mehsus farmaya aur 2 aadmiyon ka sahara lekar khadey ho gaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paon zameen par nishan kar rahe they. is tarah chal kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein dakhil huey. jab Abu-Bakar ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aahat paai to peechhey hatney lagey isliye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ishaare se rokaa phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke baain taraf baith gaey to Abu-Bakar khadey hokar Namaz padh rahe they. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baith kar Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki iqtida (pairvi) kar rahe they aur log Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki iqtidaa."
"714","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (zuhar ki Namaz mein) 2 rakaat padh kar Namaz khatm kar di to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zul-yadain ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah! kya Namaz kam ho gaee hai ya aap bhool gaey hain? is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (aur logon ki taraf dekh kar) puchha kya zul-yadain sahi kehtey hain? logon ne kaha ke haan! phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uthey aur dusri 2 rakatein bhi padhein. phir salam pheraa. phir takbeer kahi aur sajda kya pahley ki tarah ya us se kuchh lamba sajda."
"715","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (eik martaba ( Zohar ki sirf 2 hi rakatein padhaaiin (aur bhool se salam pher diyaa) phir kaha gaya ke aap ne sirf 2 hi rakatein padhi hain. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 rakatein aur padhein phir salam pheraa. phir 2 sajdey kiye."
"716","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne maut ke marz mein farmaya ke Abu-Bakar se logon ko Namaz padhaaney ke liye kaho. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) kehti hain ke maine kaha ke Abu-Bakar agar aap ki jagah khadey huey to roney ki wjah se logon ko apni awaz na suna sakengey. isliye aap umr (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaiye ke wo Namaz padhaaein. aap ne phir farmaya ke nahi Abu-Bakar hi se Namaz padhaaney ke liye kaho. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan karti hain ke maine Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se kaha ke tum bhi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz karo ke agar Abu-Bakar aap ki jagah khadey huey to aapko yad karke giryaa w zaarii ki wjah se logon ko Quran na suna sakengey . isliye umr (Raziallahu anhu) se kahey ke wo Namaz padhaaein. Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne bhi keh diya. is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, bas chup raho, tum log Yusuf (Alaihissalam) se kisi tarah kam nahi ho Abu-Bakar se kaho ke wo Namaz padhaaiin. baad mein Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se kaha, bhala mujh ko tum se kahin bhalai honii hai."
"717","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Namaz main apni safon ko barabar kar lo, nahi to Allah Taala tumhara munh ulat dega."
"718","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, safein seedhi kar lo. main tumhen apni peeth ke peechhey se dekh raha hun."
"719","Namaz ke liye takbeer kahi gaee to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna munh hamari taraf kya aur farmaya ke apni safein barabar kar lo aur mil kar khadey ho jao. main tum ko apni peeth ke peechhey se bhi dekhta rehta hun."
"722","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke imam isliye hota hai taake uski pairwi ki jaey, isliye tum us se ikhtilaf na karo. jab wo rukoo karey to tum bhi rukoo karo aur jab wo (سمع الله لمن حمده) kahey to tum ( ربنا لك الحمد ( kaho aur jab wo sajda karey to tum bhi sajda karo aur jab wo baith kar Namaz padhey to tum sab bhi baith kar padho aur Namaz mein safain barabar rakho, kyonke Namaz ka Husn safon ke barabar rakhney mein hai."
"723","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke safain barabar rakho kyonke safon ka barabar rakhna Namaz ke qaaim karne mein dakhil hai."
"724","jab wo ( Basra se) Madina aaey, to aap se puchha gaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahade-mubaarak aur hamarey us daur mein aap ne kya farq paya. farmaya ke aur to koi baat nahi sirf log safain barabar nahi kartey aur Aqba-bin-Ubaid ne Basheer-bin-Yasaar se yun riwayat kya ke Anas (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey paas Madina tashrif laey. phir yahi hadis bayan ki."
"725","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, safain barabar kar lo. main tumhen apne peechhey se bhi dekhta rehta hon aur ham mein se har shakhs ye karta ke (saff mein) apna kandhaa apne sathi ke kandhey se aur apna qadam (paaun) iske qadam ( paon ( se mila deta tha."
"726","aik raat maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (aap ke ghar mein tahajjud ki) Namaz padhi. mein aap ke baain taraf khada ho gaya. isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne peechhey se mera sar pakad kar mujhey apne daain taraf kar diya. phir Namaz padhi aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey jab muazzan (namaz ki itlaa dene ( aaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz padhaaney ke liye khadey huey aur wuzu nahi kya."
"727","maine aur aik yateem ladkey (Zameera-bin-abii-Zameera) ne jo hamarey ghar mein maujood tha, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey Namaz padhi aur meri walida Umme-Sulaim hamarey peechhey thin."
"728","mein aik raat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baain taraf (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar mein) Namaz ( tahajjud ( padhney ke liye khada ho gaya. isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera sar ya bazu pakad kar mujh ko apni daain taraf khada kar diya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne hath se ishara kya tha ke peechhey se ghoom aao."
"729","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat main apne hujre ke andar ( tahajjud ki) Namaz padhtey they. hujrey ki diwarein past thin isliye logon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh liya aur kuchh log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki iqtida (pairvi) mein Namaz ke liye khadey ho gaey. subah ke waqt logon ne iska zikr dusron se kya. phir jab dusri raat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey to kuchh log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki iqtida (pairvi) mein us raat bhi khadey ho gaey. ye sura 2 ya teen raat tak rahi. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baith rahe aur Namaz ke maqam par tashrif nahi laey. phir subah ke waqt logon ne iska zikr kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main dara ke kahin raat ki Namaz ( tahajjud ( tum par farz na ho jaey. (is khayal se maine yahan ka aana naagha kar diyaa)."
"730","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik chatai thi. jisey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) din mein bichhaatey they aur raat mein iska parda kar letey they. phir chand log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas khadey huey ya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf jhukey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey Namaz padhney lagey."
"731","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ramazan mein aik hujra bana liya ya ot ( parda ( Basar-bin-Saeed ne kaha, main samajhta hun wo boriye ka tha. aap ne kai raat usmein Namaz padhi. sahaba mein se kuchh hazraat ne un raaton mein aap ki iqtida (pairvi) ki. jab aapko iska ilm hua to aap ne baith rehna shuru kya (namaz rok rakhii) phir baraamad huey aur farmaya tum ne jo kya wo mujh ko malum hai, lekin logo ! tum apne gharon mein Namaz padhtey raho kyonke behtar Namaz aadmi ki wahi hai jo uske ghar mein ho. magar farz Namaz (masjid mein padhni zaroori hai) aur Affaan-bin-Muslim ne kaha ke ham se Wuhaib ne bayan kya, kaha ke ham se Musa-bin-Aqba ne bayan kya, kaha ke maine abu-Nazar-ibn-abii-Umayya se suna, wo Basar-bin-Saeed se riwayat kartey they, wo zaid-bin-Saabit se, wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"732","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik ghodey par Sawar huey aur) gir janey ki wjah se) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke daaein pahlu mein zakhm aa gaey. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne batlaya ke us din hamein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik Namaz padhai, chunkey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey huey they, isliye ham ne bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey baith kar Namaz padhi. phir salam ke baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke imam isliye hai ke uski pairwi ki jaey. isliye jab wo khadey ho kar Namaz padhey to tum bhi khadey ho kar padho aur jab wo rukoo karey to tum bhi rukoo karo aur jab wo sar uthaey to tum bhi uthao aur jab wo sajda karey to tum bhi karo aur jab wo (سمع الله لمن حمده) kahey to tum ( ربنا ولك الحمد ( kaho."
"733","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghodey se gir gaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) zakhmi ho gaey, isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baith kar Namaz padhi aur ham ne bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki iqtida (pairvi) mein baith kar Namaz padhi. phir Namaz padh kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke imam isliye hai ke uski pairwi ki jaey. isliye jab wo takbeer kahey to tum bhi takbeer kaho. jab wo rukoo karey to tum bhi rukoo karo. jab wo sar uthey to tum bhi uthao aur jab wo ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kahey to tum ( ربنا لك"
"734","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, imam isliye hai ke uski pairwi ki jaey, isliye jab wo takbeer kahey to tum bhi takbeer kaho. jab wo rukoo karey to tum bhi rukoo karo aur jab wo ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kahey to tum ( ربنا ولك الحمد (aur jab wo sajda karey to tum bhi sajda karo aur jab wo baith kar Namaz padhey to tum sab bhi baith kar Namaz padho."
"735","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz shuru kartey waqt apne donon hathon ko kandhon tak uthaatey, isi tarah jab rukoo ke liye (Allaahu-akbar) kehtey aur jab apna sar rukoo se uthatey to donon hath bhi uthatey (rafa' yadain kartey) aur rukoo se sar Mubarak uthatey huey ( سمع الله لمن حمده , Mina padhi. ربنا ولك"
"736","jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz ke liye khadey huey to takbeer tahreema ke waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rafa'-yadain kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke donon hath us waqt moondhon ( kandhon ( tak uthey aur isi tarah jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rukoo ke liye takbeer kehtey us waqt bhi) rafa'-yadain ( kartey. us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kehtey ( سمع الله لمن"
"737","jab wo Namaz shuru kartey to takbeere-tahreema ke sath rafa'-yadain kartey, phir jab rukoo mein jatey us waqt bhi rafa'-yadain kartey aur jab rukoo se sar uthatey tab bhi kartey aur unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi isi tarah kya kartey they."
"738","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz takbeer tahreema se shuru kartey aur takbeer kehtey waqt apne donon hathon ko kandhon tak utha kar ley jatey aur jab rukoo ke liye takbeer kehtey tab bhi isi tarah kartey aur jab ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kehtey tab bhi isi tarah kartey aur) ربنا ولك"
"739","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) jab Namaz mein dakhil hotey to pahley takbeer tahreema kehtey aur sath hi rafa'-yadain kartey. isi tarah jab wo rukoo kartey tab aur jab ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kehtey tab bhi) rafa'-yadain kartey ( donon hathon ko uthatey aur jab Qada اولیٰ se uthtey tab bhi rafa'-yadain kartey. aap ne us amal ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchaayaa. (ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) isi tarah Namaz padha kartey they.)"
"740","logon ko hukm diya jata tha ke Namaz mein dayan hath baain kalaaii par rakhein , abu-Hazim bin-Dinar ne bayan kya ke mujhey achi tarah yad hai ke aap usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchaatey they. Ismail bin abi ovais ne kaha ke ye baat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchai jati thi yun nahi kaha ke pahunchaatey they."
"741","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke, kya tum samajhtey ho ke mera munh idhar (qible ki taraf) hai. Allah ki qism tumhara rukoo aur tumhara khushoo mujh se kuchh chipa hua nahi hai, main tumhen apne peechhey se bhi dekhta rehta hun."
"742","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya rukoo aur sujood poori tarah kya karo. Allah ki qasam! main tumhen apne peechhey se bhi dekhta rehta hon ya is tarah kaha ke peeth peechhey se jab tum rukoo kartey ho aur sajda kartey ho (to main tumhen dekhta hun ( ."
"743","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz ( الحمد لله رب"
"744","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) takbeer tahreema aur qirat ke darmyan thodi der chup rahtey they. Abu-Zaraa ne kaha, main samajhta hun Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne yun kaha ya Rasulullah ! aap par mere maan-baap fidaa hun. aap us takbeer aur qirat ke darmyan ki khamoshi ke beech mein kya padhtey hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main padhta hon اللهم باعد بيني وبين خطاياى كما باعدت بين المشرق والمغرب ، Mina padhi. اللهم نقني من الخطايا كما ينقى الثوب الأبيض من الدنس ، Mina padhi. اللهم اغسل خطاياى بالماء والثلج والبرد aey Allah ! mere aur mere gunahon ke darmyan itni doori kar jitni mashriq aur maghrib mein hai. aey Allah ! mujhey gunahon se is tarah paak kar jaisey safaid kapda mail se paak hota hai. aey Allaah! mere gunahon ko paanii, barf aur oley se dho daal."
"745","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne suraj gehen ki Namaz padhi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab khadey huey to der tak khadey rahe phir rukoo mein gaey to der tak rukoo mein rahe. phir rukoo se sar uthaya to der tak khadey hi rahe. phir ( dobara ( rukoo mein gaey aur der tak rukoo ki haalat mein rahe aur phir sar uthaayaa, phir sajda kya aur der tak sajde mein rahe. phir sar uthaya aur phir sajda kya aur der tak sajde mein rahe phir khadey huey aur der tak khadey hi rahe. phir rukoo kya aur der tak rukoo mein rahe. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sar uthaya aur der tak khadey rahe. phir (dobaara) rukoo kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) der tak rukoo ki haalat mein rahe. phir sar uthaayaa. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajde mein chaley gaey aur der tak sajde mein rahe. jab Namaz se farigh huey to farmaya ke jannat mujh se itni nazdeek ho gaee thi ke agar main chahta to iske khoshon mein se koi khosha tum ko tod kar la deta aur mujh se dozakh bhi itni qareeb ho gaee thi ke main bol padaa ke mere Malik main to usmein se nahi hoon? maine wahan aik aurat ko dekha. Naafe bayan kartey hain ke mujhey khayal hai ke ibne-abi-Mulaika ne batlaya ke us aurat ko aik billi nauch rahi thi, maine puchha ke uski kya wjah hai? jawab mila ke us aurat ne us billi ko baandhey rakha tha yahan tak ke bhook ki wjah se wo mar gaee, na to usne usey khana diya aur na chhoda ke wo khud kahin se kha letii. Naafe ne bayan kya ke mera khayal hai ke ibne-abi-Mulaika ne yun kaha ke na chhoda ke wo zameen ke keedey wghaira kha letii."
"746","kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar aur Asr ki rakaton mein (faatiha ke siwaa) aur kuchh qirat kartey they? unhon-ne farmaya ke haan. ham ne kaha ke aap log ye baat kis tarah samajh jatey they. farmaya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dadhi Mubarak ke hilney se."
"747","jab wo ( sahaba ( Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz padhtey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke rukoo se sar uthaney ke baad us waqt tak khadey rahtey jab tak dekhtey ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajde mein chaley gaey hain (is waqt wo bhi sajdey mein jatey ( ."
"748","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein suraj gehen hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne gehen ki Namaz padhi. logon ne puchha ke ya Rasulullah ! ham ne dekha ke (namaz mein) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni jagah se kuchh leney ko aagey badhey they phir ham ne dekha ke kuchh peechhey hatey . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine jannat dekhi to usmein se aik khosha lena chaha aur agar main ley leta to us waqt tak tum usey khaatey rahtey jab tak duniya maujood hai."
"749","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham ko Namaz padhai. phir member par tashrif laey aur apne hath se qible ki taraf ishara karke farmaya ke abhi jab main Namaz padha raha tha to jannat aur dozakh ko us diwar par dekha. uski tasweerein us diwar mein qible ki taraf namudaar huin to maine aaj ki tarah khair aur shar kabhi nahi dekhi . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qaule-mazkoor teen baar farmaya."
"750","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, logon ka kya haal hai jo Namaz main apni nazrein aasman ki taraf uthatey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se bahut hi zyada sakhti se rokaa. yahan tak Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke log us harkat se baaz aa jayen warna unki beenaaii uchak li jaeygi."
"751","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Namaz mein idhar-udhar dekhney ke barey mein poochha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to daaka hai jo shaitan bandey ki Namaz par daalta hai."
"752","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik dhaarii daar chadar mein Namaz padhi. phir farmaya ke iske naqsh w nigaar ne mujhey ghaafil kar diya. usey ley ja kar abu-Jaheem ko wapas kar do aur unse (bajaaey iske) saadii chadar maang laao."
"753","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masjid mein qible ki diwar par raint dekhi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt logon ko Namaz padha rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (namaz hi mein) raint ko khurch dala. phir Namaz se farigh honey ke baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab koi Namaz mein hota hai to Allah Taala iske munh ke samney hota hai. isliye koi shakhs samney ki taraf Namaz mein na thookey . us hadis ki riwayat Musa-bin-Aqba aur Abdul-Azeez ibne-abi Rawaad ne Naafe se ki."
"754","(Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wafat k marz mein) musalman fajr ki Namaz padh rahe they, achcha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre se parda hataya . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba ko dekha. sab log safain baandhey huey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (khushii se) khub khul kar muskuraaey aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh kar) peechhey hatna chaha taake saf mein mil jaaein. aap ne samjha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif la rahe hain. sahaba (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh kar khushi se is qadr be-qaraar huey ke maano) Namaz hi chhod dengey. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ishara kya ke apni Namaz poori kar lo aur parda daal liya. isi din chasht ko Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wafat paaii."
"755","ahale-koofa ne Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) ki umr Faarooq (Raziallahu anhu) se shikayat ki. isliye umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko hataakar Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ko Kufa ka Hakim banaya, to Kufa walon ne Sad ke mutaalliq yahan tak keh diya ke wo to achi tarah Namaz bhi nahi padha saktey. chunanche umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko bula bhejaa. aap ne unse puchha ke aey Abu-Is'haaq! un Kufa walon ka khayal hai ke tum achi tarah Namaz nahi padha saktey ho. is par aap ne jawab diya ke Allah ki qasam! main to unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hi ki tarah Namaz padhaataa tha, usmein kotahi nahi karta isha ki Namaz padhaataa to uski 2 pehli rakaat mein (qir'at) lambi karta aur dusri 2 rakatein halki padhaataa. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke aey Abu-Ishaq ! mujh ko tum se ummeed bhi yahi thi. phir aap ne Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath aik ya kai aadmiyon ko Kufa bhejaa. qaasid ne har-har masjid mein ja kar unke mutaalliq poochha. sab ne aap ki tareef ki lekin jab masjid banii-Abbas mein gaey. to aik shakhs jiska naam Usaama-bin-Qataada aur kunniyat Abu-Sa'ada thi khada hua. usne kaha ke jab aap ne Allah ka waasta de kar puchha hai to (suniye ke) Sad na fauj ke sath khud jihad kartey they, na maale-ghanimat ki taqseem sahi kartey they aur na faisley mein adl w insaf kartey they. Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne (ye sun kar) farmaya ke Allah ki qism main ( tumhari is baat par) teen duaein karta hun. aey Allaah! agar tera ye banda jhoota hai aur sirf dikhawey ke liye khada hua hai to uski umr-daraaz kar aur usey khub mohtaaj bana aur usey fitnon mein mubtala kar. iske baad (wo shakhs us darja bdhaal hua ke) jab us se puchha jata to kehta ke aik boodha aur pareshan haal hon mujhey Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ki baddua lag gaee. Abdul-Malik ne bayan kya ke maine usey dekha uski bhawein budhapey ki wjah se aankhon par aa gaee thi. lekin ab bhi raston mein wo ladkiyon ko chhedtaa ."
"756","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jis shakhs ne sura Fatiha na padhi uski Namaz nahi hui."
"757","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein tashrif laey iske baad aik aur shakhs aaya. usne Namaz padhi, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam kya. aap ne salam ka jawab de kar farmaya ke wapas jao aur phir Namaz padh, kyonke tu ney Namaz nahi padhi. wo shakhs wapas gaya aur pahley ki tarah Namaz padhi aur phir aa kar salam kya. lekin aap ne us martaba bhi yahi farmaya ke wapas ja aur dobara Namaz padh, kyonke tu ney Namaz nahi padhi. aap ne is tarah teen martaba kya. aakhir us shakhs ne kaha ke us zaat ki qasam! jisne aapko haq ke sath maboos kya hai. main iske ilawa aur koi achchha tariqa nahi janta, isliye aap mujhey Namaz sikhaa dijiye. aap ne farmaya ke jab Namaz ke liye khada ho to pahley takbeer tahreema keh. phir aasani ke sath jitna Quran tujh ko yad ho uski tilawat kar. iske baad rukoo kar, achi tarah se rukoo ho ley to phir sar utha kar poori tarah khada ho jaa. iske baad sajda kar poorey itminan ke saath. phir sar utha aur achi tarah baith jaa. isi tarah apni tamam Namaz poori kar."
"758","main in (koofa waalon) ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki tarah Namaz padhaataa tha. Zohar aur Asr ki donon namaazein, kisi qism ka naqs unmein nahi chhorta tha. pehli 2 rakatein lambi padhta aur dusri 2 rakatein halki . to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke mujh ko tum se ummeed bhi yahi thi."
"759","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar ki pehli 2 rakaton mein sura Fatiha aur har rakaat mein eik-eik sura padhtey they, unmein bhi qirat kartey they lekin aakhiri 2 rakatein halki padhatey they kabhii-kabhii ham ko bhi koi aayat suna diya kartey they. Asr mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sura Fatiha aur soortein padhtey they, uski bhi pehli 2 rakatein lambi padhtey. isi tarah subah ki Namaz ki pehli rakaat lambi kartey aur dusri halkii."
"760","kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar aur Asr mein qirat kya kartey they? to unhon-ne batlaya ke haan, ham ne puchha ke aap logon ko kis tarah malum hota tha? farmaya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dadhi Mubarak ke hilney se."
"761","kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar aur Asr ki namazon mein qirat kya kartey they? to unhon-ne kaha ke haan! maine kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qirat karne ko aap log kis tarah malum kar letey they? farmaya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dadhi Mubarak ke hilney se."
"762","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar aur Asr ki 2 rakaat mein sura Fatiha aur eik-eik sura padhtey they. aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kabhi kabhii koi aayat hamein suna bhi diya kartey."
"763","umme-Fazal (Raziallahu anhu) (unki maan ( ne unhein (Sura Mursalaat) padhtey huey suna. phir kaha ke aey betey ! tum ne is sura ki tilawat karke mujhey yad dilaayaa. mein aakhir umr main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko maghrib mein yahi sura padhtey huey suntii thi."
"764","Zaid-bin-Saabit ne mujhey tokaa ke tumhen kya ho gaya hai ke tum maghrib mein chhoti chhotii soortein padhtey ho. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko 2 lambi Suraton mein se aik sura padhtey huey suna."
"765","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko maghrib mein sura taur padhtey huey suna tha."
"766","maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath isha ki Namaz padhi. usmein aap ne ( إذا السماء انشقت ( padhi aur sajda ( tilawat ( kya. maine unse iske mutaalliq malum kya to batlaya ke maine abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey bhi (is aayat mein tilawat ka ( sajda kya hai aur zindagi bhar mein usmein sajda karunga, yahan tak ke main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mil jaun."
"767","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar mein they ke isha ki 2 pehli rakaat mein se kisi aik rakaat mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( والتين والزيتون ( padhi."
"768","maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath isha padhi, aap ne ( إذا السماء انشقت (aur sajda kya. is par maine kaha ke ye sajda kaisa hai? aap ne jawab diya ke is sura mein maine abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey sajda kya tha. isliye main bhi hamesha usmein sajda karunga, yahan tak ke aap se mil jaun."
"769","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko isha main ( والتين والزيتون ( padhtey suna. maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada achi awaz ya achi qirat wala kisi ko nahi paya."
"770","ameerul-momineen umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke aap ki shikayat Kufa walon ne tamam hi baton mein ki hai, yahan tak ke Namaz mein bhii. unhon-ne kaha ke mera amal to ye hai ke pehli 2 rakaat mein qirat lambi karta hun aur dusri 2 mein mukhtasar jis tarah maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey Namaz padhi thi usmein kisi qism ki kami nahi karta. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke sach kehtey ho. tum se ummeed bhi isi ki hai."
"771","main apne bap ke sath abu-Barza Aslami sahabi (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaya. ham ne aap se Namaz ke waqton ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar ki Namaz suraj dhalney par padhtey they. Asr jab padhtey to Madina ke intihai kinara tak aik shakhs chala jata. lekin suraj ab bhi baqi rahtaa. maghrib ke mutaalliq jo kuchh aap ne kaha wo mujhey yad nahi raha aur isha ke liye tehai raat tak der karne mein koi harj mehsus nahi kartey they aur aap us se pahley soney ko aur uske baad baat cheet karne ko na-pasand kartey they. jab Namaz subah se farigh hotey to har shakhs apne qareeb baithey huey ko pehchan sakta tha. aap donon rakaat mein ya aik mein sath se lekar so tak aayatein padhtey."
"772","har Namaz mein Quran Majeed ki tilawat ki jaeygi. jin main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Quran sunaya tha ham bhi tumhen unmein sunaengey aur jin namazon mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aahista qirat ki ham bhi unmein aahista hi qirat karengey aur agar sura Fatiha hi padho jab bhi kafi hai, lekin agar zyada padh lo to aur behtar hai."
"773","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik martaba chand sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Ukaaz ke bazar ki taraf gaey. un dinon shayatin ko aasman ki khabrein leney se rok diya gaya tha aur un par angaarey ( Shahab Saqib ( phainkey janey lagey they. to wo shayatin apni qaum ke paas aaey aur puchha ke baat kya hui. unhon-ne kaha ke hamein aasman ki khabrein leney se rok diya gaya hai aur (jab ham aasman ki taraf jatey hain to ( ham par shahaabe-Saqib phainkey jatey hain. shayatin ne kaha ke aasman ki khabrein leney se rokney ki koi nai wjah hui hai. isliye tum mashriq w maghrib mein har taraf phail jao aur us sabab ko malum karo jo tumhen aasman ki khabrein leney se rokney ka sabab hua hai. wjah malum karne ke liye nikley huey shayatin tahaama ki taraf gaey jahan Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ukaaz ke bazar ko jatey huey maqam nakhla main apne ashaab ke sath namaaze-fajr padh rahe they. jab Quran Majeed unhon-ne suna to ghaur se uski taraf kaan laga diye. phir kaha, Allah ki qasam! yahi hai jo aasman ki khabrein sunney se rokney ka baais bana hai. phir wo apni qaum ki taraf lautey aur kaha qaum ke logo! ham ne hairat-angez Quran suna jo seedhey rastey ki taraf hidayat karta hai. isliye ham is par eman latey hain aur apne rab ke sath kisi ko Sharik nahi thahraatey. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par ye aayat nazil hui ( قل أوحي"
"774","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jin namazon mein buland awaz se Quran Majeed padhney ka hukm hua tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unmein buland awaz se padha aur jin mein aahista se padhney ka hukm hua tha unmein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aahista se padha aur tera rab bhoolney wala nahi aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi tumharey liye behtreen namoona hai."
"774b","Anas ne kaha: Ansar mein se ek shakhs Quba ki masjid mein Ansar ko namaz padhaya karte thay aur unki aadat thi ke jab bhi woh namaz mein koi surah padhna chahate, to Qul Huwallahu Ahad padhte. Jab woh us surah ko khatam karte, to uske saath ek aur surah padhte. Woh har rakat mein yahi tareeqa apnate thay. Unke saathiyon ne unse is baare mein baat ki aur kaha, ""Aap ye surah padhte hain aur ise kaafi nahi samajhte, phir doosra padhte hain. To aap ya to ise akela padh liya karein ya ise chhod kar koi aur padha karein."" Unhone kaha..."
"775","aik shakhs Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha ke maine raat aik rakaat mein mufassal ki sura padhi. aap ne farmaya ke kya isi tarah (jaldii-jaldii) padhi jaisey sher padhey jatey hain. main un ek jaisi Suraton ko janta hun jinhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik sath mila kar padhtey they. aap ne mufassal ki bees Suraton ka zikr kya. har rakaat ke liye 2-2 soortein."
"776","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar ki 2 pehli rakaton mein sura Fatiha aur 2 soortein padhtey they aur aakhiri 2 rakaat mein sirf sura Fatiha padhtey . kabhi kabhii hamein aik aayat suna bhi diya kartey they aur pehli rakaat mein qirat dusri rakaat se zyada kartey they. Asr aur subah ki Namaz mein bhi aap ka yahi mamool (routine) tha."
"777","kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar aur Asr mein Quran Majeed padhtey they? unhon-ne jawab diya ke haan! ham ne puchha ke aapko malum kis tarah hota tha. unhon-ne bataya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dadhi Mubarak ke hilney se."
"778","mujh se Abdullah-bin-Ubai Qatada ne bayan kya, wo apne walid abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar aur Asr ki 2 pehli rakaton mein sura Fatiha aur koi aur sura padhtey they. kabhi kabhii Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) koi aayat hamein suna bhi diya kartey they. pehli rakaat mein qirat zyada lamba kartey they."
"779","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar ki pehli rakaat mein (qir'at) lamba kartey they aur dusri rakaat mein mukhtasar. subah ki Namaz mein bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) isi tarah kartey they."
"780","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab imam ( Aameen ( kahey to tum bhi) Aameen ( kaho. kyonke jiski ( Aameen ( malaaika ke Aameen ke sath ho gaee iske pichhley tamam gunah maaf kar diye jaengey. ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( Aameen ( kehtey they."
"781","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab koi tum mein se ( Aameen ( kahey aur farishton ne bhi usi waqt aasman par) Aameen ( kahi . is tarah aik ki) Aameen ( doosrey ke) Aameen (ke sath mil gaee to iske pichhley tamam gunah maaf ho jatey hain."
"782","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab (غير المغضوب عليهم wla الضالين) kahey to tum bhi) Aameen ( kaho kyonke jisne farishton ke sath ( Aameen ( kahi uske pichhley tamam gunah maaf kar diye jatey hain. Sumaii ke sath us hadis ko Muhammad-bin-Amr ne abu-Salma se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kya aur Nuaim Mujmir ne bhi Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"783","wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf (namaz padhney ke liye) gaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt rukoo mein they. isliye saf tak pahunchne se pahley hi unhon-ne rukoo kar liya, phir iska zikr Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to aap ne farmaya ke Allah tumhara shauq aur zyada karey lekin dobara aisa na karna."
"784","unhon-ne Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Basra mein aik martaba Namaz padhi. phir kaha ke hamein unhon-ne wo Namaz yad dila di jo ke ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath padha kartey they. phir kaha ke Ali (Raziallahu anhu) jab sar uthatey aur jab sar jhukaatey us waqt takbeer kehtey."
"785","aap logon ko Namaz padhatey they, to jab bhi wo jhuktey aur jab bhi wo uthtey takbeer zaroor kehtey. phir jab farigh hotey to farmatey ke main Namaz padhney main tum sab logon se zyada Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz se mushabihat (similarity) rakhney wala hun."
"786","maine aur Imran-bin-Husain ne Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ke peechhey Namaz padhi. to wo jab bhi sajda kartey to takbeer kehtey. isi tarah jab sar uthatey to takbeer kehtey. jab 2 rakaat ke baad uthtey to takbeer kehtey. jab Namaz khatm hui to Imran-bin-Husain ne mera hath pakad kar kaha ke Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne aaj Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz yad dilai , ya ye kaha ke us shakhs ne ham ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz ki tarah aaj Namaz padhai."
"787","maine aik shakhs ko maqaame-Ibraaheem mein (namaz padhtey huey) dekha ke har jhukney aur uthney par wo takbeer kehta tha. isi tarah khadey hotey waqt aur baithtey waqt bhii. maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ko uski itlaa di. aap ne farmaya, arey teri maan marey ! kya ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki si Namaz nahi hai."
"788","maine Makka mein aik boodhey ke peechhey (zuhar ki) Namaz padhi. unhon-ne (tamaam Namaz mein) baaiis takbeerein kahiin. is par maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke ye boodha bilkul be aql malum hota hai Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya tumhari maan tumhen roey ye to abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sunnat hai. aur Moosaa-bin-Ismaaeel ne yun bhi bayan kya ke ham se Aban ne bayan kya, ke kaha ham se Qatada ne, unhon-ne kaha ke ham se Ikrima ne ye hadis bayan ki."
"789","unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne batlaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Namaz ke liye khadey hotey to takbeer kehtey. phir jab rukoo kartey tab bhi takbeer kehtey they. phir jab sar uthatey to ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kehtey aur khadey hi khadey ( ربنا لك الحمد ( kehtey. phir jab (doosrey) sajde ke liye jhuktey tab takbeer kehtey aur jab sajde se sar uthatey tab bhi takbeer kehtey. isi tarah aap tamam Namaz poori kar letey they. Qada اولیٰ se uthney par bhi takbeer kehtey they. (is hadis mein) Abdullaah-bin-Saaleh ne Leis ke waastey se (bajaaey ( ربنا لك الحمد ( ke) ( ربنا ولك الحمد ( naql kya hai. ( ربنا لك الحمد ( kahey ya ( ربنا ولك الحمد ("
"790","maine apne walid ke pahlu mein Namaz padhi aur apni donon hatheliyon ko mila kar raanon ke darmyan rakh liya. is par mere bap ne mujhey tokaa aur farmaya ke ham bhi pahley isi tarah kartey they. lekin baad mein us se rok diye gaey aur hukm hua ke ham apne hathon ko ghutnon par rakhein."
"791","Huzaifa-bin-Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik shakhs ko dekha ke na rukoo poori tarah karta hai na sajda. isliye aap ne us se kaha ke tum ne Namaz hi nahi padhi aur agar tum mar gaey to tumhari maut us sunnat par nahi hogi jis par Allah Taala ne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paida kya tha."
"792","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke rukoo w sujood , donon sajdon ke darmyan ka waqfa aur jab rukoo se sar uthatey to taqriban sab barabar they. siwa qiyam aur tashahud ke baithney ke."
"793","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein tashrif ley gaey. itney mein aik shakhs aaya aur Namaz padhney laga. Namaz ke baad usne aa kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salam ka jawab de kar farmaya ke wapas ja kar dobara Namaz padh, kyonke tu ney Namaz nahi padhi. chunanche usne dobara Namaz padhi aur wapas aa kar phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam kya, aap ne us martaba bhi yahi farmaya ke dobara ja kar Namaz padh, kyonke tu ney Namaz nahi padhi. teen baar isi tarah hua. aakhir us shakhs ne kaha ke us zaat ki qism ! jisne aapko maboos kya. main to us se achi Namaz nahi padh sakta. isliye aap mujhey sikhlaaiye. aap ne farmaya jab to Namaz ke liye khada ho to (pahley) takbeer keh phir Quran Majeed se jo kuchh tujh se ho sakey padh, iske baad rukoo kar aur poori tarah rukoo mein chala jaa. phir sar utha aur poori tarah khada ho jaa. phir jab to sajda karey to poori tarah sajde mein chala jaa. phir (sajde se) sar utha kar achi tarah baith jaa. dobara bhi isi tarah sajda kar. yahi tariqa Namaz ke tamam (rak'aton mein) ikhtiyar kar."
"794","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rukoo aur sajde main ( سبحانك اللهم ربنا وبحمدك , Mina اللهم اغفر لي ( padha kartey they."
"795","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kehtey to iske baad) اللهم ربنا ولك الحمد ( bhi kehtey. isi tarah jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rukoo kartey aur sar uthatey to takbeer kehtey. donon sajdon se khadey hotey waqt bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( الله أكبر ( kaha kartey they."
"796","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab imam ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kahey to tum ( اللهم ربنا ولك الحمد ( kaho. kyonke jiska ye kehna farishton ke kehney ke sath hoga, iske pichhley tamam gunah bakhsh diye jaaeinge."
"797","lo main tumhen Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz ke qareeb kar doonga. chunanche Abu-Hurera (rz), zuhar, isha aur subah ki aakhiri rakaat mein qunoot padha kartey they. ( سمع الله لمن"
"798","Anas (Allah să-l binecuvânteze) a povestit:\n\nQunut [rugăciunea înclinată înainte de prosternare] era rostit în timpul rugăciunii de seară (Maghrib) și a celei de dimineață (Fajr)."
"799","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki iqtida (pairvi) mein Namaz padh rahe they. jab aap rukoo se sar uthatey to ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kehtey. aik shakhs ne peechhey se kaha ( ربنا ولك الحمد , Mina حمدا كثيرا طيبا مباركا فيه (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz se farigh ho kar malum farmaya ke kis ne ye kalimaat kahey hain, us shakhs ne jawab diya ke maine. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tees se zyada farishton ko dekha ke un kalimaat ko likhney mein wo aik doosrey par sabqat ley jana chahtey they."
"800","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) hamein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz ka tariqa batlatey they. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz padhtey aur jab apna sar rukoo se uthatey to itni der tak khadey rahtey ke ham sochney lagtey ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhool gaey hain."
"801","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke rukoo', sajda, rukoo se sar uthatey waqt aur donon sajdon ke darmyan ka baithna taqriban barabar hota tha."
"802","Maalik-bin-Huwairis (Raziallahu anhu) hamein (namaz padh kar) dikhlaatey ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kis tarah Namaz padhtey they aur ye Namaz ka waqt nahi tha. chunanche aap (eik martaba ( khadey huey aur poori tarah khadey rahe. phir jab rukoo kya aur poore itmeenaan ke sath sar uthaya tab bhi thodi der seedhey khadey rahe. abu-Qilaba ne bayan kya ke Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamarey us Shekh abu-Yazeed ki tarah Namaz padhai. abu-Yazeed jab doosrey sajde se sar uthatey to pahley achi tarah baith letey phir khadey hotey."
"803","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) tamam namazon mein takbeer kaha kartey they. chahe farz hon ya na hun. Ramazan ka mahina ho ya koi aur mahina ho, chunanche jab aap Namaz ke liye khadey hotey to takbeer kehtey, rukoo mein jatey to takbeer kehtey. phir ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kehtey aur uske baad) ربنا ولك الحمد ( sajde se pahley, phir jab sajde ke liye jhuktey to ( الله أكبر ( kehtey. phir sajde se sar uthatey to ( الله أكبر ( kehtey. phir doosra sajda kartey waqt ( الله أكبر ( kehtey. isi tarah sajde se sar uthatey to ( الله أكبر ( kehtey. 2 rakaat ke baad Qa'dae-Oola (do rakaat k baad baithkar attahiyaat padhne k liye baithne) ke baad jab khadey hotey tab bhi takbeer kehtey aur aap har rakaat mein aisa hi kartey yahan tak ke Namaz se farigh honey tak. Namaz se farigh honey ke baad farmatey ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tum mein sabse zyada Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz se mushabeh (similar) hun aur aap isi tarah Namaz padhtey rahe yahan tak ke aap duniya se tashrif ley gaey."
"804","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab sare Mubarak (rukoo' se) uthatey to ( سمع الله لمن حمده , Mina ربنا ولك الحمد ( keh kar chand logon ke liye duaein kartey aur naam ley lekar farmatey. ya Allaah! Waleed bin Waleed, Salma bin Hishaam, Ayash bin abi Rabee aur tamam kamzor musalmanon ko (kuffaar se) nijat de. aey Allaah! qabila Muzar ke logon ko sakhti ke sath kuchal de aur un par qahat musallat kar jaisa ke Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ke zamane mein aaya tha. un dinon poorab waley qabila Muzar ke log mukhalifon mein they."
"805","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghodey se zameen par gir gaey. Sufiyan ne aksar (bajaaey ( an (an) فرس ( Mina ke) ( من فرس ( Mina kaha. us girney se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka dayan pahlu zakhmi ho gaya to ham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein iyaadat ki gharaz se hazir huey. itney mein Namaz ka waqt ho gaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein baith kar Namaz padhai. ham bhi baith gaey. Sufiyan ne aik martaba kaha ke ham ne bhi baith kar Namaz padhi. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz se farigh ho gaey to farmaya ke imam isliye hai ke uski iqtida (pairvi) ki jaey. isliye jab wo takbeer kahey to tum bhi takbeer kaho. jab rukoo karey to tum bhi rukoo karo. jab sar uthaey to tum bhi sar uthao aur jab wo ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kahey to tum ( ربنا ولك الحمد (aur jab sajda karey to tum bhi sajda karo. (Sufiyaan ne apne shagird Ali-bin madeenii se puchha ke) kya Mamar ne bhi isi tarah hadis bayan ki thi. (Ali kehtey hain ke) maine kaha ji haan. is par Sufiyan boley ke Mamar ko hadis yad thi. Zohri ne yun kaha (ولك"
"806","logon ne puchha : ya Rasulullah ! kya ham apne rab ko qiyamat mein dekh sakengey ? aap ne ( jawab ke liye) poochha, kya tumhen chaudahwiin raat ke chaand ke dekhney mein jabke iske qareeb kahin badal bhi na ho shuba hota hai? log boley hargiz nahi ya Rasulullah ! phir aap ne puchha aur kya tumhen suraj ke dekhney mein jabke iske qareeb kahin badal bhi na ho shuba hota hai. logon ne kaha ke nahi ya Rasulullah ! phir aap ne farmaya ke rabbul-izzat ko tum isi tarah dekhogey. log qiyamat ke din jama kiye jaengey. phir Allah Taala farmaeyga ke jo jisey poojtaa tha wo iske sath ho jaey. chunanche bahut se log suraj ke peechhey ho lengey , bahut se chaand ke aur bahut se buton ke sath ho lengey. ye ummat baqi reh jaeygi. ismein munaafeqeen bhi hongey. phir Allah Taala aik nai sura mein aaeyga aur unse kahega ke main tumhara rab hun. wo munaafeqeen kahengey ke ham yahin apne rab ke aaney tak khadey rahengey. jab hamara rab aayega to ham usey pehchan lengey. phir izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah unke paas (aisii sura mein jisey wo pehchan lein) aaeyga aur farmaeyga ke main tumhara rab hun. wo bhi kahengey ke beshak to hamara rab hai. phir Allah Taala bulaaeyga. pul siraat jahannam ke beechon beech rakha jaeyga aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey hain ke main apni ummat ke sath us se guzarney wala sabse pahlaa rasool hoonga. us roz siwa anbiya ke koi bhi baat na kar sakega aur anbiya bhi sirf ye kahengey. aey Allaah! mujhey mehfooz rakhiyo! aey Allaah! mujhey mehfooz rakhiyo! aur jahannam mein Sadan ke kaanton ki tarah aankdey hongey. Sadan ke kaantey to tum ne dekhey hongey ? sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya kaha haan ! (aap ne farmaya ( to wo Sadan ke kaanton ki tarah hongey. albatta unke tool w arz ko siwa Allah Taala ke aur koi nahi janta. ye aankdey logon ko unke aamaal ke mutabiq kheench lengey. bahut se log apne amal ki wjah se halaak hongey. bahut se tukdey-tukdey ho jaengey. phir unki nijat hogi. jahannamiyon mein se Allah Taala jis par raham farmana chaahega to malaaika ko hukm dega ke jo khalis Allah Taala hi ki ibadat kartey they unhein bahar nikaal lo. chunanche unko wo bahar nikaalengey aur ek khuda ke maannewaalon (muwahhidon) ko sajdey ke aasaar se pahchaanengey. Allah Taala ne jahannam par sajde ke aasaar ka jalaanaa haram kar diya hai. chunanche ye jab jahannam se nikaley jaeinge to asaare-sajda ke siwa unke jism ke tamam hi hisson ko aag jalaa chuki hogi. jab jahannam se bahar hongey to bilkul jal chukey hongey. isliye un par aabe-hayaat daala jaeyga jisse wo is tarah ubhar aaeingey. jaisey sailaab ke koode-karkat par sailaab ke thamney ke baad sabza ubhar aata hai. phir Allah Taala bandon ke hisab se farigh ho jaeyga lekin aik shakhs jannat aur dozakh ke darmyan ab bhi baqi reh jaeyga ye jannat mein dakhil honey wala aakhiri dozakhi shakhs hoga. iska munh dozakh ki taraf hoga. isliye kahega ke aey mere rab! mere munh ko dozakh ki taraf se pher de. kyonke uski badboo mujh ko maarey dalti hai aur uski chamak mujhey jalaaey deti hai. Allah Taala poochhega kya agar teri ye tamanna poori kar dun to to dobara koi nayaa sawal to nahi karega? banda kahega nahi teri buzurgi ki qasam! aur jaisey jaisey Allah chaahega wo qaul w qarar karega . aakhir Allah Taala jahannam ki taraf se iska munh pher dega. jab wo jannat ki taraf munh karega aur uski shadabi nazron ke samney aai to Allah ne jitni der chaha wo chup rahega. lekin phir bol padega aey Allah ! mujhey jannat ke darwazey ke qareeb pahuncha de. Allah Taala poochhega kya tu ney ahad w paiman nahi baandha tha ke us aik sawal ke siwa aur koi sawal to nahi karega. banda kahega aey mere rab! mujhey teri makhlooq mein sabse zyada bad-naseeb na hona chahiye Allah rabbul-izzat farmaeyga ke phir kya zamaanat hai ke agar teri ye tamanna poori kar di gaee to doosra koi sawal to nahi karega. banda kahega nahi teri izzat ki qism ab doosra sawal koi tujh se nahi karunga. chunanche apne rab se har tarah ahad w paiman baandhega aur jannat ke darwazey tak pahuncha diya jaeyga darwaze par pahunch kar jab jannat ki pinhaaii, taazgi aur musarraton ko dekhega to jab tak Allah Taala chaahega wo banda chup rahega. lekin aakhir bol padega ke aey Allaah! mujhey jannat ke andar pahuncha de. Allah Taala farmaeyga. afsos aey ibne-Aadam! to aisa daghaa baaz kyon bin gayaa? kya ( abhi ( tu ney ahad w paiman nahi baandha tha ke jo kuchh mujhey diya gaya, us se zyada aur kuchh na maangunga. banda kahega aey rab! mujhey apni sabse zyada bad-naseeb makhlooq na bana . Allah paak hans dega aur usey jannat mein bhi daakhile ki ijazat ata farma dega aur phir farmaeyga maang kya hai teri tamannaa. chunanche wo apni tamannaein (Allah taala ke saamney) rakhega aur jab tamam tamannaein khatm ho jaengi to Allah Taala farmaeyga ke falan cheez aur maango, falan cheez ka mazeed sawal karo. khud Allah paak hi yad dihaanii karaaega aur jab wo tamam tamannaein poori ho jaengi to farmaeyga ke tumhen ye sab aur itni hi aur di gaiin. Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye aur us se das guna aur zyada tumhen di gaiin. is par Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki yahi baat sirf mujhey yad hai ke tumhen ye tamannaein aur itni hi aur di gaiin. lekin abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke maine aapko ye kehtey suna tha ke ye aur uski das guna tamannaein tujh ko di gaiin."
"807","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Namaz padhtey sajdey mein apne donon baazuon ko itna phaila detey ke baghl ki safedi zahir ho jati thi. Lais-bin-Sad ne bayan kya ke mujh se bhi Jafar bin Rabeea ne isi tarah hadis bayan ki."
"808","unhon-ne aik shakhs ko dekha jo rukoo aur sajda poori tarah nahi karta tha. jab wo Namaz padh chuka to unhon-ne usse farmaya ke tu ney Namaz hi nahi padhi. abu-Waeil ne kaha ke mujhey yad aata hai ke Huzefa ne ye farmaya ke agar tum mar gaey to tumhari maut Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke tareeq par nahi hogii."
"809","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko saat (7) aaza par sajde ka hukm diya gaya, is tarah ke na baalon ko apne samet'tey, na kapdey ko (wo saat (7) aaza ye hain) peshani (jismein naak bhi shamil hai) donon haath, donon ghutney aur donon paaun."
"810","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hamein saat (7) aaza par is tarah sajde ka hukm hua hai ke ham na baal sametein na kapdey."
"811","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki iqtida (pairvi) mein Namaz padhtey they. jab aap ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kehtey (yani rukoo se sar uthatey ( to ham mein se koi us waqt tak apni peeth na jhukata jab tak Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni peshani zameen par na rakh detey."
"812","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya mujhey saat (7) aaza par sajda karne ka hukm hua hai. peshani par aur apne hath se naak ki taraf ishara kya aur donon hath aur donon ghutney aur donon paon ki ungliyon par. is tarah ke ham na kapdey sametein na baal."
"813","mein Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. maine kaha ke falan nakhlistaan mein kyon na chalein sair bhi karengey aur kuchh baatein bhi karengey. chunanche aap tashrif ley chaley. abu-Salma ne bayan kya ke maine raah mein kaha ke shabe-qadr se mutaalliq aap ne agar kuchh Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai to usey bayan kijiye . unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ramazan ke pahley ashrey (10 dino) mein aetikaf kya aur ham bhi aap ke sath aetikaf mein baith gaey, lekin Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne aa kar bataya ke aap jiski talash mein hain (shabe-qadr) wo aagey hai. chunanche aap ne doosrey ashrey mein bhi aetikaf kya aur aap ke sath ham ne bhii. Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) dobara aaey aur farmaya ke aap jiski talash mein hain wo (raat ( aagey hai. phir aap ne beeswiin Ramazan ki subah ko khutba diya. aap ne farmaya ke jisne mere sath aetikaf kya ho wo dobara kare. kyonke shabe-qadr mujhey malum ho gaee lekin main bhool gaya aur wo aakhiri ashre (10 dinon) ki taaq raaton mein hai aur maine khud ko keechad mein sajda kartey dekha. masjid ki chhat khajoor ki daaliyon ki thi. matla' bilkul saaf tha ke itney mein aik patlaa sa badal ka tukda aaya aur barasney laga. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham ko Namaz padhai aur maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki peshani aur naak par keechad ka asar dekha. aap ka khuwab sachcha ho gaya."
"814","kuchh log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath tehband chhotey honey ki wjah se unhein gardanon se baandh kar Namaz padhtey they aur aurton se keh diya gaya tha ke jab tak mard achi tarah baith na jayen tum apne saron ko) sajda se) na uthaao."
"815","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hukm tha ke saat (7) haddiyon par sajda karein aur baal aur kapdey na sametein ."
"816","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya mujhey saat (7) haddiyon par is tarah sajde ka hukm hua hai ke na baal sametoon aur na kapdey."
"817","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajda aur rukoo mein aksar ye padha kartey they. ( سبحانك اللهم ربنا وبحمدك , Mina اللهم اغفر لي ( (is dua ko padh kar) aap Quran ke hukm par amal kartey they."
"820","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka sajda, rukoo aur donon sajdon ke darmyan baithney ki miqdar taqriban barabar hoti thi."
"821","maine jis tarah Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Namaz padhtey dekha tha bilkul isi tarah tum logon ko Namaz padhaaney mein kisi qism ki koi kami nahi chhorta hun. Sabit ne bayan kya ke Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) aik aisa amal kartey they jisey main tumhen kartey nahi dekhta . jab wo rukoo se sar uthatey to itni der tak khadey rahtey ke dekhney wala samajhta ke bhool gaey hain aur isi tarah donon sajdon ke darmyan itni der tak baithtey rahtey ke dekhney wala samajhta ke bhool gaey hain."
"822","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sajde mein aetidaal ka khayal rakho aur apne bazu kutton ki tarah na phailaayaa karo."
"823","aap ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Namaz padhtey dekha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab taaq rakaat mein hotey to us waqt tak na uthtey jab tak thodi der baith na letey."
"824","mein Namaz padha raha hun lekin meri niyat kisi farz ki adaaeygi nahi hai balke mein sirf tum ko ye dikhaana chahta hun ke Nabi Karim kis tarah Namaz padha kartey they. Ayub sakhtiyan ne bayan kya ke maine abu-Qilaba se puchha ke Malik (Raziallahu anhu) kis tarah Namaz padhtey they? to unhon-ne farmaya ke hamarey Shekh Amr bin Salma ki tarah . Ayub ne bayan kya ke Shekh tamam takbeerein kehtey they aur jab doosrey sajde se sar uthatey to thodi der baithtey aur zameen ka sahara lekar phir uthtey."
"825","hamein Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne Namaz padhai aur jab unhon-ne sajde se sar uthaya to pukar kar takbeer kahi phir jab sajda kya to aisa hi kya phir sajde se sar uthaya to bhi aisa hi kya isi tarah jab 2 rakatein padh kar khadey huey us waqt bhi aap ne buland awaz se takbeer kahi aur farmaya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko isi tarah kartey dekha."
"826","maine aur Imran-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ki iqtida (pairvi) mein Namaz padhi. aap ne jab sajda kya, sajde se sar uthaya 2 rakaton ke baad khadey huey to har martaba takbeer kahi . jab aap ne salam pher diya to Imran-bin-Husain ne mera hath pakad kar kaha ke unhon-ne waqei hamein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki tarah Namaz padhai hai ya ye kaha ke mujhey unhon-ne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz yad dila di."
"827","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko wo hamesha dekhtey ke aap Namaz mein chaar-zaanoo baithtey hain mein abhi nau-umr tha maine bhi isi tarah karna shuru kar diya lekin Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se rokaa aur farmaya ke Namaz mein sunnat ye hai ke) tashahud mein) dayan paon khada rakhey aur bayan phaila de maine kaha ke aap to usi ( meri ( tarah kartey hain aap boley ke) kamzori ki wjah se) mere paon mera bojh nahi utha patey ."
"828","wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chand ashaab (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath baithey huey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz ka zikr honey laga to abu Humaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mujhey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz tum sabse zyada yad hai maine aapko dekha ke jab aap takbeer kehtey to apne hathon ko kandhon tak ley jatey, jab aap rukoo kartey to ghutnon ko apne hathon se poori tarah pakad letey aur peeth ko jhukaa detey. phir jab rukoo se sar uthatey to is tarah seedhey khadey ho jatey ke tamam jod seedhey ho jatey. jab aap sajda kartey to aap apne hathon ko) zameen par) is tarah rakhtey ke na bilkul phailey huey hotey aur na simte huey. paon ki ungliyon ke munh qible ki taraf rakhtey. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2 rakaton ke baad baithtey to baain paon par baithtey aur dayan paon khada rakhtey aur jab aakhiri rakaat mein baithtey baain paon ko aagey kar letey aur daain ko khada kar detey phir maqad (peeth) par baithtey . Leis ne Yazeed bin abi Habib se aur Yazeed bin Muhammad-bin Halhala se suna aur Muhammad-bin Halhala ne ibne- ata se, aur Abu-Saleh ne Leis se ( كل فقار مكانه ( naql kya hai aur ibne-Mubarak ne Yahya bin Ayub se bayan kya unhon-ne kaha ke mujh se Yazeed bin abii-Habeeb ne bayan kya ke Muhammad-bin Amr bin-Halhala ne unse hadis main ( كل فقار ( bayan kya."
"829","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein Zohar ki Namaz padhai aur 2 rakaton par baithney ke bajaey khadey ho gaey, chunanche sarey log bhi unke sath khadey ho gaey, jab Namaz khatm honey wali thi aur log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke salam pherney ka intizar kar rahe they, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( الله"
"830","hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaaze-zuhar padhai. aapko chahiye tha baithna lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (bhool kar) khadey ho gaey phir Namaz ke aakhir mein baithey hi baithey 2 sajdey kiye."
"831","jab ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey Namaz padhtey to kehtey ( tarjama ( salam ho Jibraeel aur Mikaail par salam ho falan aur falan par) Allah par salam ( Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik roz hamari taraf mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya Allah to khud '' salam '' hai. (tum Allah ko kya salam kartey ho ( isliye jab tum mein se koi Namaz padhey to ye kahey التحيات لله ، Mina والصلوات والطيبات ، Mina Assalamualaik أيها النبي ورحمة الله وبركاته ، Mina السلام علينا وعلى عباد الله الصالحين tamaam aadaabe-bandagii, tamam ibaadatein aur tamam behtreen ta'reefein Allah ke liye hain. aap par salam ho aey Nabi aur Allah ki rahmatein aur uski barkatein ham par salam aur Allah ke tamam Saleh bandon par salaam. jab tum ye kahogey to tumhara salam aasman w zameen mein jahan koi Allah ka nek banda hai usko pahunch jaeyga mein gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi aur gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad uske bandey aur rasool hain."
"834","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey koi aisi dua sikhaa dijiye jisey main Namaz mein padha karun. aap ne farmaya ke ye dua padha karo (اللهم إني zulmat نفسي ظلما كثيرا wla يغفر الذنوب إلا أنت ، Mina فاغفر لي مغفرة من عندك ، Mina وارحمني إنك أنت الغفور الرحيم )aey Allah ! maine apni jaan par) gunah karke ( bahut zyada zulm kya to gunahon ko terey siwa koi doosra maaf karne wala nahi. mujhey apne paas se bharpur maghfirat ata farma aur mujh par raham karke maghfirat karne wala aur raham karne wala beshak w shuba to hi hai."
"835","(pahley ( jab ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz padhtey to ham ( Qada mein) ye kaha kartey they ke iske bandon ki taraf se Allah par salam ho aur falan par aur falan par salam ho. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye na kaho ke ''Allah par salam ho'' kyonke Allah to khud salam hai. balke ye kaho (التحيات لله ، Mina والصلوات والطيبات ، Mina Assalamualaik أيها النبي ورحمة الله وبركاته ، Mina السلام علينا وعلى عباد الله الصالحين)aadaabe-bandagaan aur tamam ibaadatein aur tamam pakeeza khairaatein Allah hi ke liye hain aap par aey Nabi salam ho aur Allah ki rahmatein aur barkatein nazil hon ham par aur Allah ke Saleh bandon par salam ho aur jab tum ye kaho gey to aasman par Allah ke tamam bandon ko pahunchega Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aasman aur zameen ke darmyan tamam bandon ko pahunchey ga (أشهد أن لا إله إلا الله ، Mina وأشهد أن محمدا عبده"
"836","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko keechad mein sajda kartey huey dekha. mitti ka asar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki peshani par saaf zahir tha."
"837","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab (namaz se) salam phertey to salam ke khatm hotey hi auratein khadi ho jaatiin ( bahar aaney ke liye) aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey honey se pahley thodi der thahrey rahtey they. ibne-Shahab (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha, main samajhta hun aur pura ilm to Allah hi ko hai Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) isliye thahar jatey they ke auratein jaldi chali jayen aur mard Namaz se farigh ho kar unko na paaein."
"838","ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz padhi. phir jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salam phera to ham ne bhi salam pheraa."
"841","buland awaz se zikr, farz Namaz se farigh honey par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane Mubarak mein jari tha."
"842","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz khatm honey ko takbeer (Allaahu-akbar) ki wjah se samajh jata tha. Ali-bin madeenii ne kaha ke ham se Sufiyan ne Amr ke hawale se bayan kya ke abu-Ma'bad Ibne-Abbas ke ghulaamon mein sabse zyada qaabile-bharosa they. Ali-bin madeenii ne bataya ke unka naam Nafiz tha."
"843","naadaar log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur kaha ke ameer w raees log buland darjaat aur hamesha rehney wali jannat hasil kar chukey halanke jis tarah ham Namaz padhtey hain wo bhi padhtey hain aur jaisey ham rozey rakhtey hain wo bhi rakhtey hain lekin maal w daulat ki wjah se unhein ham par fauqiyat hasil hai ke uski wjah se wo Haj kartey hain. Umra kartey hain. jihad kartey hain aur sadqey detey hain (aur ham mohtaajii ki wjah se in kaamon ko nahi kar paatey) is par aap ne farmaya ke lo main tumhen aik aisa amal bataataa hon ke agar tum uski pabandi karogey to jo log tum se aagey badh chukey hain unhein tum paalo gey aur tumharey martabe tak phir koi nahi pahunch sakta aur tum sabse achchhey ho jaogey siwa unke jo yahi amal shuru kar dein har Namaz ke baad 33-33 martaba tasbeeh (Sub'haanAllah), Mina tahmeed (الحمد لله), Mina takbeer ( الله أكبر ( kaha karo. phir ham mein ikhtilaf ho gaya kisi ne kaha ke ham tasbeeh ( sub'haanAllah) tentis martaba , tahmeed ( الحمد لله ( tentis martaba aur takbeer ( الله أكبر ( chauntis martaba kahengey. maine is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se dobara malum kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) sub'haanAllah) , Mina ( الحمد لله (aur ( الله"
"844","mujh se Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) ne Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ko aik khat mein likhwaayaa ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har farz Namaz ke baad ye dua padhtey they (لا إله إلا الله وحده لا شريك له ، Mina padhi. له الملك ، Mina padhi. وله الحمد ، Mina padhi. وهو على كل شىء قدير ، Mina padhi. اللهم لا مانع لما أعطيت ، Mina padhi. wla معطي لما منعت ، Mina padhi. wla ينفع ذا الجد منك الجد)Allaah ke siwa koi laaiqe-ibaadat nahi. iska koi Sharik nahi. badhshahat uski hai aur tamam tareef usi ke liye hai. wo har cheez par qaadir hai. aey Allah jisey to de usse rokney wala koi nahi aur jisey to na de usey dene wala koi nahi aur kisi maaldaar ko uski daulat w maal teri bargah mein koi nafa na pahuncha sakengey. Shoba ne bhi Abdul-Malik se isi tarah riwayat ki hai. Hasan ne farmaya ke) hadis mein lafz ( )"
"845","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Namaz (farz) padha chuktey to hamari taraf munh kartey."
"846","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Hudaibiya mein subah ki Namaz padhai aur raat ko barish ho chuki thi Namaz se farigh honey ke baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ki taraf munh kya aur farmaya malum hai tumharey rab ne kya farmaya hai. logon ne kaha ke Allah aur uske rasool khub jantey hain (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) tumharey rab ka irshad hai ke subah hui to mere kuchh bandey mujh par eman laey aur kuchh mere munkar huey jisne kaha ke Allah ke Fazal aur uski rehmat se hamarey liye barish hui to wo mera momin hai aur sitaron ka munkir aur jisne kaha ke falan taarey ke fulaanii jagah par aaney se barish hui wo mera munkir hai aur sitaron ka momin."
"847","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik raat ( isha ki) Namaz mein der farmai taqriban aadhi raat tak. phir aakhir hujre se bahar tashrif laey aur Namaz ke baad hamari taraf munh kya aur farmaya ke doosrey log Namaz padh kar so chukey lekin tum log jab tak Namaz ka intizar kartey rahe maano ke Namaz mein rahe (yani tum ko Namaz ka sawab milta raha ( ."
"848","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) nafl ( usi jagah par padhtey they aur jis jagah farz padhtey aur Qasim-bin-Muhammad -bin-abi-Bakr ne bhi isi tarah kya hai aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se marfooan riwayat hai ke imam apni ( farz padhney ki) jagah par nafl na padhey aur ye sahi nahi."
"851","maine Madina main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki iqtida (pairvi) mein aik martaba Asr ki Namaz padhi. salam pherney ke baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jaldi se uth khadey huey aur safon ko cheertey huey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni kisi biwi ke hujre mein gaey. log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki us tezi ki wjah se ghabraa gaey. phir jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey aur jaldi ki wjah se logon ke tajjub ko mehsus farmaya to farmaya ke hamarey paas aik soney ka dala ( taqseem karne se) bach gaya tha mujhey usmein dil laga rehna bura malum hua, maine iske baant dene ka hukm de diyaa.`"
"852","koi shakhs apni Namaz mein se kuchh bhi shaitan ka hissa na lagaey is tarah ke dahini taraf hi lautnaa apne liye zaroori qarar de ley. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aksar baain taraf se laut'tey dekha."
"853","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jange-khaibar ke mauqe par kaha tha ke jo shakhs us darakht yani lehsun ko khaaey huey ho usey hamari masjid mein na aana chahiye (kachchaa lehsun ya piyaz khana murad hai ke us se munh mein bo paida ho jati hai)."
"854","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs ye darakht khaaey (aap ki murad lehsun se thi) to wo hamari masjid mein na aaey Ata ne kaha maine Jaabir se puchha ke aap ki murad us se kya thi. unhon-ne jawab diya ke aap ki murad sirf kachchey lehsun se thi. Mukhlid bin Yazeed ne ibne-Juraij ke waaste se ( الانیہ ke bajaey)"
"855","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo lehsun ya piyaz khaaey huey ho to wo ham se door rahe ya (ye kaha ke usey ( hamari masjid se door rehna chahiye ya usey apne ghar mein hi baithna chahiye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik handi laai gaee jis mein kai qism ki harii tarkaariyaan thin. (piyaaz ya gandanaa bhi) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usmein bo mehsus ki aur uske mutaalliq malum kya. us saalan mein jitni tarkaariyaan dali gaee thin wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bata di gaiin. wahan aik sahabi maujood they Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uski taraf ye saalan badha do. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey khana pasand nahi farmaya aur farmaya ke tum log kha lo. meri jin se sargoshi rehti hai tumhari nahi rehti aur Ahmed bin Saleh ne ibne- Wahab se yun naql kya ke thaal Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laai gaee thi. ibne-Wahab ne kaha ke tabaq jis mein harii tarkaariyaan thin aur Leis aur abu-Safwaan ne Yunus se riwayat mein handi ka qissa nahi bayan kya hai. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne (ya Saeed ya ibne- Wahab ne kaha ( mein nahi keh sakta ke ye khud Zohri ka qaul hai ya hadis mein dakhil hai."
"856","aap ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se lehsun ke barey mein kya suna hai. unhon-ne bataya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs us darakht ko khaaey wo hamarey qareeb na aaey hamarey sath Namaz na padhey ."
"857","jo (eik martaba ( Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik akelii alag thalag tooti hui qabr par se guzar rahe they wahan Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhai aur log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey saf baandhey huey they. Sulaiman ne kaha ke maine Shabi se puchha ke abu-Amr aap se ye kis ne bayan kya to unhon-ne kaha ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne."
"858","unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Juma ke din har baligh ke liye ghusl zaroori hai."
"859","aik raat main apni khala Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan soyaa aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi wahan so gaey. phir raat ka aik hissey jab guzar gaya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur aik latkii hui mashk se halka sa wuzu kya. Amr ( rawi hadis ne) us wuzu ko bahut hi halka batlaya (yani usmein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bahut kam pani istemal farmaya ( phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz ke liye khadey huey iske baad maine bhi uth kar isi tarah wuzu kya jaisey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya tha phir main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baain taraf khada ho gaya. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey dahini taraf pher diya phir Allah Taala ne jitna chaha Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhi phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) let rahe phir so gaey. yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kharraatey leney lagey. aakhir muazzan ne aa kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Namaz ki khabar di aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iske sath Namaz ke liye tashrif le gaey aur Namaz padhai magar ( nayaa ( wuzu nahi kya Sufiyan ne kaha, ham ne Amr-bin-Dinar se kaha ke log kehtey hain ke (sotey waqt) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki) sirf ( aankhen soti thin lekin dil nahi sota tha. Amr-bin-Dinar ne jawab diya ke maine Ubaid-bin-Umair se suna wo kehtey they ke anbiya ka khuwab bhi wahiy hota hai phir Ubaid ne us aayat ki tilawat ki) إني أرى في المنام أني"
"860","(unki maan) Ishaq ki daadi Muleka (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khaney par bulaya jisey unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye bataur-ziyaafat taiyaar kya tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khana khaya phir farmaya ke chalo main tumhen Namaz padha dun. hamarey yahan aik boriyaa tha jo puraanaa honey ki wjah se siyah ho gaya tha. maine usey pani se saaf kya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur (peechhey) mere sath yateem ladka (zameera-bin-Sa'd) khada hua. meri boodhi daadi (mulaika Umme-Sulaim) hamarey peechhey khadi huin phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein 2 rakaat Namaz padhai."
"861","main aik gadhi par Sawar ho kar aaya. abhi main jawaanii ke qareeb tha ( lekin baligh na tha) aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Mina mein logon ko Namaz padha rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney diwar wghaira ( aad ( na thi. main saf ke aik hissey ke aagey se guzar kar utraa. gadhi charney ke liye chhod di aur khud saf mein shamil ho gaya. kisi ne mujh par aetraz nahi kya (halanke mein nabaligh thaa)."
"862","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik raat isha mein der ki aur Ayash ne ham se Abdul-Aala se bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ke ham se Mamar ne Zohri se bayan kya, unse Urwa ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne isha mein aik martaba der ki. yahan tak ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne awaz di ke auratein aur bachchey so gaey. unhon-ne farmaya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar aaey aur farmaya ke (is waqt) poori zameen par tumharey siwa aur koi us Namaz ko nahi padhta , us zamane mein Madina walon ke siwa aur koi Namaz nahi padhta tha."
"863","kya tum ne ( aurton ka ( nikalnaa eid ke din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath dekha hai? unhon-ne kaha haan dekha hai agar main aap ka rishtedar azeez na hota to kabhi na dekhta (yani meri kam-umrii aur qaraabat ki wjah se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujh ko apne sath rakhtey they) Kasir bin Salat ke makan ke paas jo nishan hai pahley wahan Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey wahan Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khutba sunaya phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aurton ke paas tashrif laey aur unhein bhi wa'z-w-naseehat ki. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse khairat karne ke liye kaha, chunanche aurton ne apne chhalley aur anguthiyan utaar-utaar kar Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ke kapdey mein daalnii shuru kar diye. aakhir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath ghar tashrif laey."
"864","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik martaba isha ki Namaz mein itni der ki ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehna padaa ke auratein aur bachchey so gaey. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (hujrey se) tashrif laey aur farmaya ke dekho poori zameen par us Namaz ka (is waqt) tumharey siwa aur koi intizar nahi kar raha hai. un dinon Madina ke siwa aur kahin Namaz nahi padhi jati thi aur log isha ki Namaz shafaq doobney ke baad se raat ki pehli tehai guzarney tak padha kartey they."
"865","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tumhari beeviyan tum se raat mein masjid aaney ki ijazat maangein to tum log unhein uski ijazat de diya karo. Ubaidullah ke sath us hadis ko Shoba ne bhi Aamash se riwayat kya, unhon-ne Mujahid se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"866","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein auratein farz Namaz se salam pherney ke fauran baad (baahar aaney ke liye) uth jati thin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur mard Namaz ke baad apni jagah baithey rehtey. jab tak Allah ko manzoor hota. phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uthtey to doosrey mard bhi khadey ho jatey."
"867","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) subah ki Namaz padh letey phir auratein chaadrein lapet kar (apne gharon ko) wapas ho jati thin. andherey se unki pehchan na ho saktii."
"868","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main Namaz ke liye khada hota hun, mera irada ye hota hai ke Namaz lambi karun lekin kisi bachchey ke roney ki awaz sun kar Namaz ko mukhtasar kar deta hun ke mujhey uski maan ko takleef dena bura malum hota hai."
"869","aaj aurton mein jo nai baatein paida ho gaee hain agar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein dekh letey to unko masjid mein aaney se rok detey jis tarah Bani-Israeel ki aurton ko rok diya gaya tha. maine puchha ke kya Bani-Israeel ki aurton ko rok diya gaya tha? aap ne farmaya ke haan."
"870","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab salam phertey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke salam phertey hi auratein janey ke liye uth jati thin aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) thodi der thahrey rahtey khadey na hotey. Zohri ne kaha ke ham ye samajhtey hain, aagey Allah jaaney, ye isliye tha taake auratein mardon se pahley nikal jaaein."
"871","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (meri maan) Umme-Sulaim ke ghar mein Namaz padhai. main aur yateem mil kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey khadey huey aur Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey peechhey thin."
"872","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) subah ki Namaz munh andherey padhtey they. musalmanon ki auratein jab (namaz padh kar) wapas hotiin to andherey ki wjah se unki pehchan na hoti ya wo aik dusri ko na pehchan saktiin."
"873","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se kisi ki biwi (namaz padhney ke liye masjid mein aaney ki) us se ijazat maangey to shauhar ko chahiye ke usko na rokey."
"874","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( meri maan ( Umme-Sulaim ke ghar mein Namaz padhai. main aur yateem mil kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey khadey huey aur Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey peechhey thin."
"875","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab salam phertey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke salam phertey hi auratein janey ke liye uth jati thin aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) thodi der thahrey rahtey khadey na hotey. Zohri ne kaha ke ham ye samajhtey hain, aagey Allah jaaney, ye isliye tha taake auratein mardon se pahley nikal jaaein."
